(3157909, 443816, 27482, '<td valign="top">Ooooo, I really like this shot but kindof feel it, well, shoehorned into this challenge, well maybe it´s cause I have lived in Scandinavia all my life but this most definately is not a harsh environment to me.  Eh, who cares, like the shot, gave it an 8, nice work.</td>', 'Ooooo, I really like this shot but kindof feel it, well, shoehorned into this challenge, well maybe it´s cause I have lived in Scandinavia all my life but this most definately is not a harsh environment to me.  Eh, who cares, like the shot, gave it an 8, nice work.', '2006-12-29 00:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157910, 441846, 66223, '<td valign="top">brrr....</td>', 'brrr....', '2006-12-29 00:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3157914, 443751, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but not really digging the pp work on this one, whatever filter or effect you used to get that "grainy spotish" look, especially on the darker areas in the shot isn´t to my taste.</td>', 'Sorry but not really digging the pp work on this one, whatever filter or effect you used to get that "grainy spotish" look, especially on the darker areas in the shot isn´t to my taste.', '2006-12-29 00:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
