(3157920, 443378, 27482, '<td valign="top">I like it, don´t really care for the frame but didn´t let that affect my vote.  Only thing is I would have liked to see MORE, I have a feeling this shot needs to be printed out big for one to really appreciate it, seeing it in low resolution web size doesn´t flatter it.  7</td>', 'I like it, don´t really care for the frame but didn´t let that affect my vote.  Only thing is I would have liked to see MORE, I have a feeling this shot needs to be printed out big for one to really appreciate it, seeing it in low resolution web size doesn´t flatter it.  7', '2006-12-29 00:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
