(3157964, 443649, 53147, '<td valign="top">Brilliant! I am so glad to see you able to do some of what you do best and then be able to vote on it. Way to take this ruleset and run with it. On the quick run through you got an 8 cause I dont usually give higher than that at first. But I will just go ahead and bump you up to the 10 you deserve and add this to my faves. Once again - Brilliant!!! Edit - adding you to my fav photographer list to boot. You have some mighty inspirational Photoshop skills and the imagination to make it all work.</td>', 'Brilliant! I am so glad to see you able to do some of what you do best and then be able to vote on it. Way to take this ruleset and run with it. On the quick run through you got an 8 cause I dont usually give higher than that at first. But I will just go ahead and bump you up to the 10 you deserve and add this to my faves. Once again - Brilliant!!! Edit - adding you to my fav photographer list to boot. You have some mighty inspirational Photoshop skills and the imagination to make it all work.', '2006-12-29 00:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
