(3158543, 443566, 52439, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but pretty harsh lighting, no pun intended.</td>', 'Nice idea, but pretty harsh lighting, no pun intended.', '2006-12-29 04:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158544, 443830, 52439, '<td valign="top">Wow, love this shot.<br/>I''d have been tempted to give it a bit of a boost in contrast and possible vignet the edges very slightly.</td>', 'Wow, love this shot.I''d have been tempted to give it a bit of a boost in contrast and possible vignet the edges very slightly.', '2006-12-29 04:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158547, 443910, 68467, '<td valign="top">Only one thing to say - WOW what´s that - love the colors - 7</td>', 'Only one thing to say - WOW what´s that - love the colors - 7', '2006-12-29 04:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158549, 443415, 68467, '<td valign="top">Love the sharpness of the eagle - nice - 6</td>', 'Love the sharpness of the eagle - nice - 6', '2006-12-29 04:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158551, 442359, 52439, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure i like this new HDR phase that seems to have arrived.<br/>Doesn''t look realistic, looks like digital art.<br/>I mean it''s well done, you nailed what i can see you were aiming for, just that i dont like that.<br/>:p</td>', 'I''m not sure i like this new HDR phase that seems to have arrived.Doesn''t look realistic, looks like digital art.I mean it''s well done, you nailed what i can see you were aiming for, just that i dont like that.:p', '2006-12-29 04:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158553, 443751, 68467, '<td valign="top">Pleasent image but a little to much noise</td>', 'Pleasent image but a little to much noise', '2006-12-29 04:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158555, 443547, 35229, '<td valign="top">Better use black frame.</td>', 'Better use black frame.', '2006-12-29 04:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158557, 443792, 52439, '<td valign="top">Very nice.<br/>If you could just have straightened that distracting hoizon.<br/>I can''t help tilting my head a little bit, haha.<br/>6.</td>', 'Very nice.If you could just have straightened that distracting hoizon.I can''t help tilting my head a little bit, haha.6.', '2006-12-29 04:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158558, 443613, 68467, '<td valign="top">That is really a Harsh Environment - 6</td>', 'That is really a Harsh Environment - 6', '2006-12-29 04:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158560, 443068, 52439, '<td valign="top">Great shot.<br/>Strong and powerful.<br/>The sides of the bridge towering up, which are lit more than the rest of the picture force you to crawl along the bridge to where your eye meets the looming dark clouds in the sky.<br/>The texture of the snow on the ridges of the bridge echo the struts of the railings with bumpy hard edges.<br/>Good choice to burn out the bottom of the photo aswell, it pushes you into the scene now.</td>', 'Great shot.Strong and powerful.The sides of the bridge towering up, which are lit more than the rest of the picture force you to crawl along the bridge to where your eye meets the looming dark clouds in the sky.The texture of the snow on the ridges of the bridge echo the struts of the railings with bumpy hard edges.Good choice to burn out the bottom of the photo aswell, it pushes you into the scene now.', '2006-12-29 04:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158561, 443809, 52439, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, and the dark shadows on the bottom shelf seem to try and hide the chemical tins.</td>', 'Nice colours, and the dark shadows on the bottom shelf seem to try and hide the chemical tins.', '2006-12-29 04:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158563, 443036, 52439, '<td valign="top">You''ve managed to capture a gorgeous scene in an indeed harsh environment.</td>', 'You''ve managed to capture a gorgeous scene in an indeed harsh environment.', '2006-12-29 04:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158564, 443792, 35229, '<td valign="top">If you would have taken this photo little more near the ground, the photo would make much more impact. The framing is killing the photo also by drawing the attention to it.</td>', 'If you would have taken this photo little more near the ground, the photo would make much more impact. The framing is killing the photo also by drawing the attention to it.', '2006-12-29 04:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158565, 442194, 68467, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and sharpness - but it don´t seems harsh - 6</td>', 'I love the colors and sharpness - but it don´t seems harsh - 6', '2006-12-29 04:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158566, 443719, 52439, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective here.<br/>I wasn''t sure about your choice to make the background out of focus, but it simply forces your eye towards the harsh and perfectly sharp rock in the foreground, which is the subject so i guess the out of focus background works well.<br/>Absolutely brilliant black and white tones though, would love to know what method you used to get them.</td>', 'Nice perspective here.I wasn''t sure about your choice to make the background out of focus, but it simply forces your eye towards the harsh and perfectly sharp rock in the foreground, which is the subject so i guess the out of focus background works well.Absolutely brilliant black and white tones though, would love to know what method you used to get them.', '2006-12-29 04:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158567, 443707, 35229, '<td valign="top">All the same character, all the same poses, and the upclose zombie does not look like dead at all. But I like what you did with the environment. Maybe you should have left your self out of it.</td>', 'All the same character, all the same poses, and the upclose zombie does not look like dead at all. But I like what you did with the environment. Maybe you should have left your self out of it.', '2006-12-29 04:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158568, 443490, 35229, '<td valign="top">Very cooool ;)</td>', 'Very cooool ;)', '2006-12-29 04:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158569, 442771, 52439, '<td valign="top">This kinda reminds of a cross between Blue Peter and Mars Attacks.<br/>Good work. :P</td>', 'This kinda reminds of a cross between Blue Peter and Mars Attacks.Good work. :P', '2006-12-29 04:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158570, 442346, 52439, '<td valign="top">This is lost on me, being English.</td>', 'This is lost on me, being English.', '2006-12-29 04:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158571, 443070, 35229, '<td valign="top">This has much to hot colors in it. The snow is almost purple.</td>', 'This has much to hot colors in it. The snow is almost purple.', '2006-12-29 04:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158572, 443913, 35229, '<td valign="top">This is going to end up high. I rate you 10.</td>', 'This is going to end up high. I rate you 10.', '2006-12-29 04:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158573, 443625, 52439, '<td valign="top">Wow, it certainly has the impact.<br/>It''s not to my tastes but Im sure it will do very well.<br/>How much of it is photography and how much digital art though? (That old arguement).</td>', 'Wow, it certainly has the impact.It''s not to my tastes but Im sure it will do very well.How much of it is photography and how much digital art though? (That old arguement).', '2006-12-29 04:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158574, 443394, 52439, '<td valign="top">A bit lifeless really. Difficult to keep the detail in the foreground while not blowing out the sky though, (as you''ve done).<br/>Try looking into a ND graduated filter, it allows you to do this shot but whilst keeping the detail in the sky.</td>', 'A bit lifeless really. Difficult to keep the detail in the foreground while not blowing out the sky though, (as you''ve done).Try looking into a ND graduated filter, it allows you to do this shot but whilst keeping the detail in the sky.', '2006-12-29 05:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158575, 443860, 68467, '<td valign="top">Nice - but a bit too much noise</td>', 'Nice - but a bit too much noise', '2006-12-29 05:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158576, 443594, 35229, '<td valign="top">It is unbelievable what those girls will not do for the sake of attention. Naked in a tire!<br/>I think you went a little overboard with the Photoshop work here. It is to obvious.</td>', 'It is unbelievable what those girls will not do for the sake of attention. Naked in a tire!I think you went a little overboard with the Photoshop work here. It is to obvious.', '2006-12-29 05:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158577, 443899, 52439, '<td valign="top">Scary darey!</td>', 'Scary darey!', '2006-12-29 05:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
