(3158789, 443613, 53147, '<td valign="top">LOL - You get an extra point for humor. This stands out well next to the outside environment shots. While maybe not a ribbon winner you still get one of my higher votes. Having been a chef for 17 years I can say that I have been there and harsh doesnt begin to explain this situation. Bumping up to 8.</td>', 'LOL - You get an extra point for humor. This stands out well next to the outside environment shots. While maybe not a ribbon winner you still get one of my higher votes. Having been a chef for 17 years I can say that I have been there and harsh doesnt begin to explain this situation. Bumping up to 8.', '2006-12-29 07:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158792, 443717, 53147, '<td valign="top">These types of shots that tell stories are the ones that should do well. Worthy of more than the 2 second look as they have an impact beyond the quick eye candy types of images. A great study and excellent interpretation of the challenge. I hope this does well for you. Bumping up to an 8 for now.</td>', 'These types of shots that tell stories are the ones that should do well. Worthy of more than the 2 second look as they have an impact beyond the quick eye candy types of images. A great study and excellent interpretation of the challenge. I hope this does well for you. Bumping up to an 8 for now.', '2006-12-29 07:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158797, 443662, 66201, '<td valign="top">I''m just going to go right out and say it: these extremely long thin images just don''t work for me in a challenge situation: after paging through images that fill the page with big bold beautiful pictures, a long skinny, is a shock to the system which has been mesmerised up to that point. Now suddenly I''ve got to lean in close to the screen and scroll up and down because I can only see part of the image at a time, and so ultimately I get to see an image about 1/8 the size of the rest. <br/> <br/>Having said that: I think your subject and composition are brilliant...if this had been a large square image it would have had so much impact.</td>', 'I''m just going to go right out and say it: these extremely long thin images just don''t work for me in a challenge situation: after paging through images that fill the page with big bold beautiful pictures, a long skinny, is a shock to the system which has been mesmerised up to that point. Now suddenly I''ve got to lean in close to the screen and scroll up and down because I can only see part of the image at a time, and so ultimately I get to see an image about 1/8 the size of the rest.  Having said that: I think your subject and composition are brilliant...if this had been a large square image it would have had so much impact.', '2006-12-29 07:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158799, 443625, 53147, '<td valign="top">Excellent creation. Overall I am glad these types of images dont heavily populate these challenges but it is nice to see one that is done so well. A creative idea executed well with excellent editing. Bumpin gup.</td>', 'Excellent creation. Overall I am glad these types of images dont heavily populate these challenges but it is nice to see one that is done so well. A creative idea executed well with excellent editing. Bumpin gup.', '2006-12-29 07:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
