(3159100, 443277, 6349, '<td valign="top">I love the photo, the processing, and the message here.  Great photo.  In my top three picks for the challenge. 9</td>', 'I love the photo, the processing, and the message here.  Great photo.  In my top three picks for the challenge. 9', '2006-12-29 10:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
