(3159791, 442359, 66201, '<td valign="top">I really feel that this would have been so much more moody and effective without the heavy processing and layers. It could have been left more "real" to have greater impact, instead of becoming a type of cartoon - "Dream" and "Harsh" seem to me at odds with each other.Sorry, I know I am coming from a position of anti-high definition photos, and this is very subjective.</td>', 'I really feel that this would have been so much more moody and effective without the heavy processing and layers. It could have been left more "real" to have greater impact, instead of becoming a type of cartoon - "Dream" and "Harsh" seem to me at odds with each other.Sorry, I know I am coming from a position of anti-high definition photos, and this is very subjective.', '2006-12-29 14:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3159793, 442341, 66201, '<td valign="top">Amazingly haunting location.</td>', 'Amazingly haunting location.', '2006-12-29 14:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
