(3159965, 443415, 58430, '<td valign="top">this is a nice image. not sure if the eagle was really captured at this location since it it advanced editing...doesn''t matter but i would like to see more negative space to the left of the eagle.  it just feels too tight with the bird so close to the left edge of the image.</td>', 'this is a nice image. not sure if the eagle was really captured at this location since it it advanced editing...doesn''t matter but i would like to see more negative space to the left of the eagle.  it just feels too tight with the bird so close to the left edge of the image.', '2006-12-29 15:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
