(3160266, 442346, 51802, '<td valign="top">I''m don''t think this meets the challenge.  How is baseball memorabilia a harsh environment?  The lighting is well done, but I wish that it wasn''t cropped so close a the top.  I think it would be better if the photo in the background did not have the heads cut off, ant this would also allow more natural lines to flow around the "C" on the cubs ball.</td>', 'I''m don''t think this meets the challenge.  How is baseball memorabilia a harsh environment?  The lighting is well done, but I wish that it wasn''t cropped so close a the top.  I think it would be better if the photo in the background did not have the heads cut off, ant this would also allow more natural lines to flow around the "C" on the cubs ball.', '2006-12-29 16:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
