(3161120, 443548, 62187, '<td valign="top">Holy Smokes! Dang, I made a rule...I rarely vote in challenges I''ve entered. I''ve entered a photo in this challenge. After seeing your photo, I mean really seeing it and thinking about the title, I''m tempted to change my mind...but alas, no. At first glance, I missed the details of your photo. I pray the other voters take the time to see what you have made. It is truely awesome! I''m sorry the 10 you deserve from me is for naught. At least I can save it to favs! Good luck to you...really...super job!</td>', 'Holy Smokes! Dang, I made a rule...I rarely vote in challenges I''ve entered. I''ve entered a photo in this challenge. After seeing your photo, I mean really seeing it and thinking about the title, I''m tempted to change my mind...but alas, no. At first glance, I missed the details of your photo. I pray the other voters take the time to see what you have made. It is truely awesome! I''m sorry the 10 you deserve from me is for naught. At least I can save it to favs! Good luck to you...really...super job!', '2006-12-29 22:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161126, 443613, 62187, '<td valign="top">The colors are nice...but as far as the challenge goes, the photo is stretching it. It''s dissapointing to see so many people not taking advantage of the expert editing rules. Don''t worry, I''m not voting.</td>', 'The colors are nice...but as far as the challenge goes, the photo is stretching it. It''s dissapointing to see so many people not taking advantage of the expert editing rules. Don''t worry, I''m not voting.', '2006-12-29 22:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161132, 443396, 62187, '<td valign="top">To me, it looks a little over-sharpened in places. You could have taken the blur tool and run it along the pasted edge of the top of the train car. Interesting otherwise.</td>', 'To me, it looks a little over-sharpened in places. You could have taken the blur tool and run it along the pasted edge of the top of the train car. Interesting otherwise.', '2006-12-29 22:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161139, 443749, 62187, '<td valign="top">I like the border...snow is cool...I rarely see it. Is it real or did you ''make'' it? Good job if so.</td>', 'I like the border...snow is cool...I rarely see it. Is it real or did you ''make'' it? Good job if so.', '2006-12-29 22:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161148, 443599, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice photo (no advanced editing though that I can tell - minus points for that) but I don''t get it. Is it parking tickets and that''s the harsh part? Sorry...I''m probaby jus stupit.</td>', 'It''s a nice photo (no advanced editing though that I can tell - minus points for that) but I don''t get it. Is it parking tickets and that''s the harsh part? Sorry...I''m probaby jus stupit.', '2006-12-29 22:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161155, 443719, 62187, '<td valign="top">Yes, but they can hold water making a harsh environment deceivingly luxourious! Looks kinda like Ansel Adams but no expert editing that I can tell. Don''t worry, I''m not voting...just commenting.</td>', 'Yes, but they can hold water making a harsh environment deceivingly luxourious! Looks kinda like Ansel Adams but no expert editing that I can tell. Don''t worry, I''m not voting...just commenting.', '2006-12-29 22:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161156, 443594, 62187, '<td valign="top">The ''thumbnailed'' version of your photo does not to justice to the larger version. I almost passed over viewing it. I hope the other voters take the time to click on it. I''m not voting in this challenge as I rarely vote in challenges I''m participating in. If I would be voting, I''d give you a 10 - which, I think there are dissapointingly, very few in this challenge. Great work and good luck!</td>', 'The ''thumbnailed'' version of your photo does not to justice to the larger version. I almost passed over viewing it. I hope the other voters take the time to click on it. I''m not voting in this challenge as I rarely vote in challenges I''m participating in. If I would be voting, I''d give you a 10 - which, I think there are dissapointingly, very few in this challenge. Great work and good luck!', '2006-12-29 22:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161159, 443068, 40667, '<td valign="top">twenty below is nothing:)</td>', 'twenty below is nothing:)', '2006-12-29 22:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161165, 442857, 62187, '<td valign="top">It looks photo-like but also like it could have been multiple photos. Hmmm...I don''t know. So, I''ll have to err on your side and say nice job!</td>', 'It looks photo-like but also like it could have been multiple photos. Hmmm...I don''t know. So, I''ll have to err on your side and say nice job!', '2006-12-29 22:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161168, 442346, 62187, '<td valign="top">You can answer your own question. What I was looking for I don''t see.</td>', 'You can answer your own question. What I was looking for I don''t see.', '2006-12-29 22:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161172, 442341, 62187, '<td valign="top">Even though I think the photo looks like a basic photo...(sorry if I''m wrong)...I still think it totally captures the spirit of the challenge.</td>', 'Even though I think the photo looks like a basic photo...(sorry if I''m wrong)...I still think it totally captures the spirit of the challenge.', '2006-12-29 22:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161189, 443649, 67841, '<td valign="top">Funny!  Excellent execution - lighting &amp; exposure match really well + you can barely tell the key.  I''ll be surprised if you don''t ribbon with this... &lt;&lt; 10 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'Funny!  Excellent execution - lighting & exposure match really well + you can barely tell the key.  I''ll be surprised if you don''t ribbon with this... << 10 >>', '2006-12-29 23:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161194, 442194, 67841, '<td valign="top">Very nice tones &amp; contrast -- a little shy of meeting the challenge, though mine was too - lol  &lt;&lt; 6 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'Very nice tones & contrast -- a little shy of meeting the challenge, though mine was too - lol  << 6 >>', '2006-12-29 23:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161204, 443069, 67841, '<td valign="top">Strong imagery :: nice B&amp;W technique :: nice use of shallow DOF :: title works perfectly for the challenge<br/> <br/>Missing the wow factor, though...   &lt;&lt; 7 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'Strong imagery :: nice B&W technique :: nice use of shallow DOF :: title works perfectly for the challenge Missing the wow factor, though...   << 7 >>', '2006-12-29 23:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161205, 442700, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very cool...I''m not voting this time around but if I were, I''d give your photo a 10.</td>', 'Very cool...I''m not voting this time around but if I were, I''d give your photo a 10.', '2006-12-29 23:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161213, 443649, 62187, '<td valign="top">You''re the King but aren''t you supposed to sit on the throne?!?!?!?! Super great work. I wish I were voting this time around...I''d give you a 10.</td>', 'You''re the King but aren''t you supposed to sit on the throne?!?!?!?! Super great work. I wish I were voting this time around...I''d give you a 10.', '2006-12-29 23:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161222, 443816, 62187, '<td valign="top">The photo, to me, doesn''t really convey much ''harshness'' - it looks kinda peaceful. We had the option, yes, it was an option, to use expert editing and I see no evidence whatsoever of anything other then a snapshot - a good one though.</td>', 'The photo, to me, doesn''t really convey much ''harshness'' - it looks kinda peaceful. We had the option, yes, it was an option, to use expert editing and I see no evidence whatsoever of anything other then a snapshot - a good one though.', '2006-12-29 23:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161234, 443918, 62187, '<td valign="top">Your photo looks pretty much like that: a photo. I don''t really see anything I think would have taken advantage of the expert editing which in your case is ok - it''s a great photo.</td>', 'Your photo looks pretty much like that: a photo. I don''t really see anything I think would have taken advantage of the expert editing which in your case is ok - it''s a great photo.', '2006-12-29 23:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161236, 443277, 51802, '<td valign="top">There is nothing in this photo to grab and hold the viewer''s interest.  There are things IN the photo, but nothing that I would call the SUBJECT of the photo. (I hope that makes sense).</td>', 'There is nothing in this photo to grab and hold the viewer''s interest.  There are things IN the photo, but nothing that I would call the SUBJECT of the photo. (I hope that makes sense).', '2006-12-29 23:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161239, 443716, 62187, '<td valign="top">Well...it looks like a snapshot...but...I don''t think so. I think you''ve probably taken advantage of the expert editing and done a very, very good job at it. I''m not voting, if I were, I''d give your photo a 10.</td>', 'Well...it looks like a snapshot...but...I don''t think so. I think you''ve probably taken advantage of the expert editing and done a very, very good job at it. I''m not voting, if I were, I''d give your photo a 10.', '2006-12-29 23:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161243, 442178, 62187, '<td valign="top">Nice representation...but that reminds me I need to go and buy more ammo and stockpile some more canned goods.</td>', 'Nice representation...but that reminds me I need to go and buy more ammo and stockpile some more canned goods.', '2006-12-29 23:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161246, 442808, 63495, '<td valign="top">i would love to now how to the that.</td>', 'i would love to now how to the that.', '2006-12-29 23:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161250, 442856, 62187, '<td valign="top">I didn''t really care for the photo...but my son saw it and said it was perfect for the challenge. So, on second thought, I''d have to say ''yes'' - it fits the challenge well. However, I was looking for more use of expert editing rather then snapshots.</td>', 'I didn''t really care for the photo...but my son saw it and said it was perfect for the challenge. So, on second thought, I''d have to say ''yes'' - it fits the challenge well. However, I was looking for more use of expert editing rather then snapshots.', '2006-12-29 23:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161259, 442395, 14476, '<td valign="top">If this is the kind of thing that''s ''allowed'' in Expert Editing, I''m all for it.  This is just lovely.  Subtle and because of that, it builds interest in the composition.  10 of course.</td>', 'If this is the kind of thing that''s ''allowed'' in Expert Editing, I''m all for it.  This is just lovely.  Subtle and because of that, it builds interest in the composition.  10 of course.', '2006-12-29 23:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161263, 443490, 62187, '<td valign="top">Hmmm? It seems like a snapshot without much editing at all. Maybe I''m wrong? I was hoping for some really cool photos with the expert editing rule in force. Your photo is still nice...I like it...I was just hoping for more.</td>', 'Hmmm? It seems like a snapshot without much editing at all. Maybe I''m wrong? I was hoping for some really cool photos with the expert editing rule in force. Your photo is still nice...I like it...I was just hoping for more.', '2006-12-29 23:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161265, 443415, 14476, '<td valign="top">Well captured.</td>', 'Well captured.', '2006-12-29 23:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161271, 443068, 62187, '<td valign="top">Yeah, I guess 20 below is harsh. Does the photo convey that...? ...somewhat. Is it expert editing, no, it''s pretty basic...inverted. It''s still a nice photo...the dead-center thing isn''t very pleasing to me...it''s your photo though and I''m sure you like it. The texture of the snow is the coolest thing...no pun intended. Over-all, I like it. I''m not voting but I''d give you an 8 if I were.</td>', 'Yeah, I guess 20 below is harsh. Does the photo convey that...? ...somewhat. Is it expert editing, no, it''s pretty basic...inverted. It''s still a nice photo...the dead-center thing isn''t very pleasing to me...it''s your photo though and I''m sure you like it. The texture of the snow is the coolest thing...no pun intended. Over-all, I like it. I''m not voting but I''d give you an 8 if I were.', '2006-12-29 23:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161275, 443614, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s a noble effort...</td>', 'It''s a noble effort...', '2006-12-29 23:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161276, 442668, 62187, '<td valign="top">Hmmm? Don''t know why but I like it!</td>', 'Hmmm? Don''t know why but I like it!', '2006-12-29 23:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161282, 443544, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why you made it look ...??? Silver, it looks silver to me.</td>', 'I''m not sure why you made it look ...??? Silver, it looks silver to me.', '2006-12-29 23:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161286, 442276, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice photo...I''m not sure about being harsh...but, it''s a very nice photo. I can see it hanging in a frame on a wall. Nice...</td>', 'It''s a nice photo...I''m not sure about being harsh...but, it''s a very nice photo. I can see it hanging in a frame on a wall. Nice...', '2006-12-29 23:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161294, 443378, 62187, '<td valign="top">Is it burned? I think so, that''s harsh. But, I was hoping for more photos that took advantage of the expert editing.</td>', 'Is it burned? I think so, that''s harsh. But, I was hoping for more photos that took advantage of the expert editing.', '2006-12-29 23:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161296, 443401, 62187, '<td valign="top">You certainly took advantage of the expert editing...maybe too much??? Anyway, thanks for that...it beats looking at so many snapshots.</td>', 'You certainly took advantage of the expert editing...maybe too much??? Anyway, thanks for that...it beats looking at so many snapshots.', '2006-12-29 23:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161300, 443620, 62187, '<td valign="top">Ok, I''ll have to take your word on it. Was hoping to see more expert editing techniques rather then snapshots.</td>', 'Ok, I''ll have to take your word on it. Was hoping to see more expert editing techniques rather then snapshots.', '2006-12-29 23:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161305, 443592, 62187, '<td valign="top">Barren? You''re kidding me? I see trees, green grass, smoke coming out of a chimney suggesting a nice warm fireplace...it''s anything but barren to me. It''s a nice photo but I don''t think it fits the spirit of the challenge. I was also hoping to see more photos that took advantage of the expert editing.</td>', 'Barren? You''re kidding me? I see trees, green grass, smoke coming out of a chimney suggesting a nice warm fireplace...it''s anything but barren to me. It''s a nice photo but I don''t think it fits the spirit of the challenge. I was also hoping to see more photos that took advantage of the expert editing.', '2006-12-29 23:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161312, 441839, 51750, '<td valign="top">Mr. Lawrence i supose?</td>', 'Mr. Lawrence i supose?', '2006-12-29 23:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161314, 443717, 62187, '<td valign="top">Regarding the photo and the photo only - it has nice focus and I like the lighting as well as the contrasting colors. To me it''s a snapshot that doesn''t seem very to have much of a harsh environment and there is no use of anything outside of basic editing. I was hoping for more.</td>', 'Regarding the photo and the photo only - it has nice focus and I like the lighting as well as the contrasting colors. To me it''s a snapshot that doesn''t seem very to have much of a harsh environment and there is no use of anything outside of basic editing. I was hoping for more.', '2006-12-29 23:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161319, 442003, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''m glad for your title because it looks like a mess and I''d never have guessed. At least you took advantage of the expert editing rules instead of entering a snapshot.</td>', 'I''m glad for your title because it looks like a mess and I''d never have guessed. At least you took advantage of the expert editing rules instead of entering a snapshot.', '2006-12-29 23:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161320, 441504, 51750, '<td valign="top">This is somewhat phantasmagoric.</td>', 'This is somewhat phantasmagoric.', '2006-12-29 23:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161325, 442842, 51750, '<td valign="top">The person looks pasted on, and probally is. I think the problem is that the person should be smaller, i geuss the perspective was different in each photo.</td>', 'The person looks pasted on, and probally is. I think the problem is that the person should be smaller, i geuss the perspective was different in each photo.', '2006-12-30 00:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161326, 443891, 62187, '<td valign="top">An excellent photo. Meets challenge? I guess you think so. Expert editing...well, it was an option I guess. Not to worry, I''m not casting votes during this challenge. I''d have scored it at 8 simply because it''s such a nice photo...quality that is and the emotivness of it.</td>', 'An excellent photo. Meets challenge? I guess you think so. Expert editing...well, it was an option I guess. Not to worry, I''m not casting votes during this challenge. I''d have scored it at 8 simply because it''s such a nice photo...quality that is and the emotivness of it.', '2006-12-30 00:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161328, 442312, 62187, '<td valign="top">The frame is pretty cool. I mean hot.</td>', 'The frame is pretty cool. I mean hot.', '2006-12-30 00:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161332, 443751, 62187, '<td valign="top">At first I thought it looked like quick-sand. No, I''ve never seen quick-sand but that''s what I thought it would look like. Anyway, nice photo...love the soft-noise feeling it has.</td>', 'At first I thought it looked like quick-sand. No, I''ve never seen quick-sand but that''s what I thought it would look like. Anyway, nice photo...love the soft-noise feeling it has.', '2006-12-30 00:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161334, 443662, 62187, '<td valign="top">Wow...are you sure that''s not 721 pixels high? It''s kinda tall. Oh, and narrow too. Different...good luck to ya!</td>', 'Wow...are you sure that''s not 721 pixels high? It''s kinda tall. Oh, and narrow too. Different...good luck to ya!', '2006-12-30 00:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161342, 443798, 70627, '<td valign="top">That is beautiful. I love the colors of the clouds.</td>', 'That is beautiful. I love the colors of the clouds.', '2006-12-30 00:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161386, 443916, 62187, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...? I''ll have to print this out so I know what to look for when the time comes. For the photo...I think I would have smoothed out the two lines near the center. Great use with the expert rules...they were fun!</td>', 'Hmmm...? I''ll have to print this out so I know what to look for when the time comes. For the photo...I think I would have smoothed out the two lines near the center. Great use with the expert rules...they were fun!', '2006-12-30 00:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161390, 442940, 62187, '<td valign="top">As a photo...it''s cool. Nice use of the expert rules. For meeting the challenge...yes, I see and agree with your message but it would be lost in the photo without a title. Otherwise, it would just seem like a fun picture.</td>', 'As a photo...it''s cool. Nice use of the expert rules. For meeting the challenge...yes, I see and agree with your message but it would be lost in the photo without a title. Otherwise, it would just seem like a fun picture.', '2006-12-30 00:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161392, 442590, 62187, '<td valign="top">Was hoping to see more use of the expert editing option.</td>', 'Was hoping to see more use of the expert editing option.', '2006-12-30 00:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161393, 443378, 66201, '<td valign="top">So desolate and sad. Perfect "subject" for the challenge.</td>', 'So desolate and sad. Perfect "subject" for the challenge.', '2006-12-30 00:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161394, 443440, 66201, '<td valign="top">Isn''t our beautiful earth and amazing place? Love the way you have all but excluded the horizon...leaving it just a thin strip to take the eye to.</td>', 'Isn''t our beautiful earth and amazing place? Love the way you have all but excluded the horizon...leaving it just a thin strip to take the eye to.', '2006-12-30 00:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161395, 443751, 66201, '<td valign="top">Delicate, and yet a strong illustration of Harsh.</td>', 'Delicate, and yet a strong illustration of Harsh.', '2006-12-30 00:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161397, 443544, 66201, '<td valign="top">Very striking...yeeeers...I tend to identify with this image. But well done on the processing. Loads of interest.</td>', 'Very striking...yeeeers...I tend to identify with this image. But well done on the processing. Loads of interest.', '2006-12-30 00:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161399, 443277, 66201, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition. The only thing I would have adjusted is the amount of the building on the left. When looking at the image ...the story begins at the place where the balconies meet the building..in a way the white of the building is wasted space:so the image ends up with a very thin bookmark effect...anyway, just my opinion.</td>', 'Beautiful composition. The only thing I would have adjusted is the amount of the building on the left. When looking at the image ...the story begins at the place where the balconies meet the building..in a way the white of the building is wasted space:so the image ends up with a very thin bookmark effect...anyway, just my opinion.', '2006-12-30 00:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161401, 443717, 66201, '<td valign="top">The title just draws the whole image together. Lovely work.</td>', 'The title just draws the whole image together. Lovely work.', '2006-12-30 00:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161404, 443555, 66201, '<td valign="top">I like the subdued tones and desaturation in this ..the very lack of over-processing is suitable. In an "expert editing" challenge, I think the real discipline is to use what you need only when you need it..not to use as much as you can just because you can, ending up with a general mess. Nice control. Fits the challenge perfectly.</td>', 'I like the subdued tones and desaturation in this ..the very lack of over-processing is suitable. In an "expert editing" challenge, I think the real discipline is to use what you need only when you need it..not to use as much as you can just because you can, ending up with a general mess. Nice control. Fits the challenge perfectly.', '2006-12-30 00:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161406, 443792, 66201, '<td valign="top">Amazing...</td>', 'Amazing...', '2006-12-30 00:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161407, 441504, 66201, '<td valign="top">Oh man, the eyes just say it all: how wickedly funny. Simple and effective. I like the cyan hue...</td>', 'Oh man, the eyes just say it all: how wickedly funny. Simple and effective. I like the cyan hue...', '2006-12-30 00:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161408, 443749, 66201, '<td valign="top">Fantastic....I just think your double border detracts from the image, which in itself has so much strength in its simplicity...?</td>', 'Fantastic....I just think your double border detracts from the image, which in itself has so much strength in its simplicity...?', '2006-12-30 00:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161411, 443594, 66201, '<td valign="top">Weird, dramatic and well processed. Beautiful use of symbolism to create a sense of "Harsh".</td>', 'Weird, dramatic and well processed. Beautiful use of symbolism to create a sense of "Harsh".', '2006-12-30 00:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161417, 443273, 62187, '<td valign="top">Famine? There''s some corn right there...hurry, grab it before the raccoons come! Sorry, couldn''t resist making a bad joke. It''s a very nice photo. The color contrast and lighting are great. I know it was an option but I was really hoping for more use of the expert editing. I''m not voting but if I were I''d have given your photo a 9.</td>', 'Famine? There''s some corn right there...hurry, grab it before the raccoons come! Sorry, couldn''t resist making a bad joke. It''s a very nice photo. The color contrast and lighting are great. I know it was an option but I was really hoping for more use of the expert editing. I''m not voting but if I were I''d have given your photo a 9.', '2006-12-30 00:44:25.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3161419, 441874, 66201, '<td valign="top">Such beauty...while this is delicate and beautiful, it illustrates a very real harsh environment. Lovely detail and clarity.</td>', 'Such beauty...while this is delicate and beautiful, it illustrates a very real harsh environment. Lovely detail and clarity.', '2006-12-30 00:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161422, 442472, 62187, '<td valign="top">Kewl...I have a photo very similar to this. Not in my portolio though. Anyway, I like the photo, I was just hoping for more use of the expert editing option.</td>', 'Kewl...I have a photo very similar to this. Not in my portolio though. Anyway, I like the photo, I was just hoping for more use of the expert editing option.', '2006-12-30 00:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161427, 443805, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s a very nice photo. Harsh - I''m not sure. Was hoping to see more use of the expert editing option.</td>', 'It''s a very nice photo. Harsh - I''m not sure. Was hoping to see more use of the expert editing option.', '2006-12-30 00:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161429, 443920, 66201, '<td valign="top">Really great shot: love the wide angle and depth that''s been created. I personally would have not included the border which detracts..would have rather let the picture merge gradually into into black outer limits...but then that''s just my opinion and preference (doesn''t factor into my scoring for this one).</td>', 'Really great shot: love the wide angle and depth that''s been created. I personally would have not included the border which detracts..would have rather let the picture merge gradually into into black outer limits...but then that''s just my opinion and preference (doesn''t factor into my scoring for this one).', '2006-12-30 00:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161430, 443396, 66201, '<td valign="top">This is very "beautiful" in it''s finish. Certainly a harsh environment, but I think the processing has beautified it and the result is cosmetically pretty. All the patina has been stripped.</td>', 'This is very "beautiful" in it''s finish. Certainly a harsh environment, but I think the processing has beautified it and the result is cosmetically pretty. All the patina has been stripped.', '2006-12-30 00:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161436, 443277, 62187, '<td valign="top">I like it...don''t know why but I do. It has a nice soft, noisy feel to it. That smokey tower thingy tops it off. Very good.</td>', 'I like it...don''t know why but I do. It has a nice soft, noisy feel to it. That smokey tower thingy tops it off. Very good.', '2006-12-30 00:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161439, 443719, 66201, '<td valign="top">Remote, desolate, beautiful, wild...been in similar places and I can feel that environment all over again: perfectly captured and composed. The black and white works well for this.</td>', 'Remote, desolate, beautiful, wild...been in similar places and I can feel that environment all over again: perfectly captured and composed. The black and white works well for this.', '2006-12-30 00:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
