(3161565, 443792, 15711, '<td valign="top">Desolate and certainly harsh. The sky is terrific. If there were possibly one thing like a dead twig, or skull, or even a living creature, it would really top it off for me. 7</td>', 'Desolate and certainly harsh. The sky is terrific. If there were possibly one thing like a dead twig, or skull, or even a living creature, it would really top it off for me. 7', '2006-12-30 01:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161569, 443509, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love all of the variation in texture and hue here. The golden on the left mountain against the navy blue of the right - nice complementary colors.  And the white of the hints of snow amidst the brown and warm tones of the foreground. Really interesting treatment. I love the title too. I wish there were one single something like a bird, a flower, a dead branch, one "off" thing and it would really make it perfect for me. 7</td>', 'I love all of the variation in texture and hue here. The golden on the left mountain against the navy blue of the right - nice complementary colors.  And the white of the hints of snow amidst the brown and warm tones of the foreground. Really interesting treatment. I love the title too. I wish there were one single something like a bird, a flower, a dead branch, one "off" thing and it would really make it perfect for me. 7', '2006-12-30 01:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161570, 443646, 15711, '<td valign="top">Terrific post editing. I love the layering effect almost as if we are looking through an aged old window to see the industrial setting beyond. 7</td>', 'Terrific post editing. I love the layering effect almost as if we are looking through an aged old window to see the industrial setting beyond. 7', '2006-12-30 01:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
