(3161576, 443920, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is glorious in the tone department.  I don''t sense a harshness, but it''s lovely with the portrait orientation. I''d kill the orange border. Great perspective.  The sky is wonderful.</td>', 'This is glorious in the tone department.  I don''t sense a harshness, but it''s lovely with the portrait orientation. I''d kill the orange border. Great perspective.  The sky is wonderful.', '2006-12-30 01:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161577, 443498, 62187, '<td valign="top">...but not bad enough to kill those birds and grass that is growing there. Don''t get me wrong, I get your point. Did you copy and paste those birds? If so, you might have considered making them look like they were floating dead.</td>', '...but not bad enough to kill those birds and grass that is growing there. Don''t get me wrong, I get your point. Did you copy and paste those birds? If so, you might have considered making them look like they were floating dead.', '2006-12-30 01:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
