(3161707, 442771, 3087, '<td valign="top">Cute idea! Nicely done. Colours are a little washed out though that''s not such an issue given content but I think a touch more saturation would be good.</td>', 'Cute idea! Nicely done. Colours are a little washed out though that''s not such an issue given content but I think a touch more saturation would be good.', '2006-12-30 06:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161713, 443625, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting image - like the use of light and shadow to add depth. Definitely a fun one.</td>', 'Interesting image - like the use of light and shadow to add depth. Definitely a fun one.', '2006-12-30 06:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161715, 443860, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice scene and I like the fogginess of the sky and the grain too. I think the shot overall is too dark in that most of the snow is a mid-tone grey. I imagine that''s because lightening the whole image would cause blowout in the sunlit area of the sky but I think some selective adjustments to bring more white in would help.</td>', 'Nice scene and I like the fogginess of the sky and the grain too. I think the shot overall is too dark in that most of the snow is a mid-tone grey. I imagine that''s because lightening the whole image would cause blowout in the sunlit area of the sky but I think some selective adjustments to bring more white in would help.', '2006-12-30 06:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161716, 442842, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love the sky of this image with the menacing clouds and rays of sunlight... but the body, whilst well posed, just doesn''t seem to belong to the landscape - it''s like it''s floating above the earth rather than lying on it.</td>', 'I love the sky of this image with the menacing clouds and rays of sunlight... but the body, whilst well posed, just doesn''t seem to belong to the landscape - it''s like it''s floating above the earth rather than lying on it.', '2006-12-30 06:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161719, 443069, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like this unusual variation on the theme - the space inside one''s mind. That said, I doubt the image would, on it''s own, bring the challenge theme to mind so you may find some voters vote you down for that. I really like the shallow depth of field which so effectively blurs foreground and background leaving only the knuckles and part of the gun in sharp focus. The close crop and angle of view both work well. So too does the nicely converted black and white presentation.</td>', 'I like this unusual variation on the theme - the space inside one''s mind. That said, I doubt the image would, on it''s own, bring the challenge theme to mind so you may find some voters vote you down for that. I really like the shallow depth of field which so effectively blurs foreground and background leaving only the knuckles and part of the gun in sharp focus. The close crop and angle of view both work well. So too does the nicely converted black and white presentation.', '2006-12-30 06:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161720, 443594, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s different! Love the contrast between frosty and abandoned tyres and warm, living flesh. Not sure I love the processing - the edges look really strange - kind of like too much sharpening but not quite the same.</td>', 'Wow, that''s different! Love the contrast between frosty and abandoned tyres and warm, living flesh. Not sure I love the processing - the edges look really strange - kind of like too much sharpening but not quite the same.', '2006-12-30 06:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161722, 443555, 3087, '<td valign="top">The location of the homeless man beneath a sign of Hope is an interesting juxtaposition. Makes the situation all the more poignant.</td>', 'The location of the homeless man beneath a sign of Hope is an interesting juxtaposition. Makes the situation all the more poignant.', '2006-12-30 06:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3161723, 443707, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely done - the high colour saturation and cloudy sky both work well to create a fantasy environment and the "zombies" work well too! The hand grabbing the frame of the shot seems a touch too red and rather clumsily cut out but the idea/ effect itself works well.</td>', 'Nicely done - the high colour saturation and cloudy sky both work well to create a fantasy environment and the "zombies" work well too! The hand grabbing the frame of the shot seems a touch too red and rather clumsily cut out but the idea/ effect itself works well.', '2006-12-30 06:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
