(3162006, 443594, 68769, '<td valign="top">At first glance this is interesting, but after looking at it, really looking at it there are a few problems.<br/>1) Skin tone is wrong with someone exposed to the elements.<br/>2) tire is unaffected by body heat.<br/>3) Tire is leaning at a angle, girl strait up and down.<br/>4) what is going on with the foot.<br/>5) Hair too clean, and at that angle impossible to be outside the tire.<br/>6) the lighting on the sky and frost color dont match.<br/>I foresee a ribbon if not already obtained in your future, you just need some work on details.</td>', 'At first glance this is interesting, but after looking at it, really looking at it there are a few problems.1) Skin tone is wrong with someone exposed to the elements.2) tire is unaffected by body heat.3) Tire is leaning at a angle, girl strait up and down.4) what is going on with the foot.5) Hair too clean, and at that angle impossible to be outside the tire.6) the lighting on the sky and frost color dont match.I foresee a ribbon if not already obtained in your future, you just need some work on details.', '2006-12-30 11:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
