(3164955, 442856, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is very harshly lit...  You used the flash on the camera?  Next time try not using the flash.  Instead put the camera on a tripod and let it expose for as long as it likes...  Results should be much less harsh and have more depth!<br/>TC</td>', 'This is very harshly lit...  You used the flash on the camera?  Next time try not using the flash.  Instead put the camera on a tripod and let it expose for as long as it likes...  Results should be much less harsh and have more depth!TC', '2006-12-31 19:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
