(3165068, 443816, 9906, '<td valign="top">Did you use HDR on this?  It''s one of the few shots in the challenge that I think use the new rules set to make something that works very well.  You have awesome detail in the background that helps to frame the lightness of the foreground.<br/>TC</td>', 'Did you use HDR on this?  It''s one of the few shots in the challenge that I think use the new rules set to make something that works very well.  You have awesome detail in the background that helps to frame the lightness of the foreground.TC', '2006-12-31 19:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
