(3165073, 443719, 9906, '<td valign="top">Great DOF.  Great choice for b/w.  Even the border adds to the overall feeling.  Love the white inline that dissappears at the top of the shot.  It does seem to be missing some little something though to take it from very nice to awesome.<br/>TC</td>', 'Great DOF.  Great choice for b/w.  Even the border adds to the overall feeling.  Love the white inline that dissappears at the top of the shot.  It does seem to be missing some little something though to take it from very nice to awesome.TC', '2006-12-31 19:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
