(3165103, 442368, 9906, '<td valign="top">The tree itself has no really interesting features to hold the viewers eye.  The moon doesn''t really help either.  If this had a really cool dramatic sky behind it maybe but as it is it looks like you just pointed your camera in the air and snappes away and decided to shoe horn it into the challenge.<br/>TC</td>', 'The tree itself has no really interesting features to hold the viewers eye.  The moon doesn''t really help either.  If this had a really cool dramatic sky behind it maybe but as it is it looks like you just pointed your camera in the air and snappes away and decided to shoe horn it into the challenge.TC', '2006-12-31 19:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
