(3165115, 442808, 9906, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what this is supposed to represent.  Don''t know how you did it.  Don''t think it fits within the spirit of the rules.<br/>TC</td>', 'Don''t know what this is supposed to represent.  Don''t know how you did it.  Don''t think it fits within the spirit of the rules.TC', '2006-12-31 19:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
