(3165130, 443070, 9906, '<td valign="top">THis is another shot that makes me wonder if you used HDR.  You have some great detail in the foreground but the sky is not overly saturated or blown out.  I do think that you have a little too much blue in your snow but (being a Michigander) appreciate how hard it is to shoot snow in shadows without that effect.<br/>TC</td>', 'THis is another shot that makes me wonder if you used HDR.  You have some great detail in the foreground but the sky is not overly saturated or blown out.  I do think that you have a little too much blue in your snow but (being a Michigander) appreciate how hard it is to shoot snow in shadows without that effect.TC', '2006-12-31 20:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
