(3165171, 443708, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is atually quite nicely done.  Love the tonality of the cold foggy air.  Nothing quite like that.  However, This shot just seems to need a little something that would take it from very nice to the ''wow'' factor.  Maybe someone walking up the path.  Don''t know what it is but it just needs that one little boost.<br/>TC</td>', 'This is atually quite nicely done.  Love the tonality of the cold foggy air.  Nothing quite like that.  However, This shot just seems to need a little something that would take it from very nice to the ''wow'' factor.  Maybe someone walking up the path.  Don''t know what it is but it just needs that one little boost.TC', '2006-12-31 20:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165172, 443918, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very nice tone to this image.  I like the somewhat brown green tinting.</td>', 'Very nice tone to this image.  I like the somewhat brown green tinting.', '2006-12-31 20:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3165174, 442668, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is a bit busy and doesn''t have enough of a subject to hold the eye.  From the title I deduce that the gates are supposed to be the subject but by their transparent nature they don''t really fill the role...<br/>TC</td>', 'This is a bit busy and doesn''t have enough of a subject to hold the eye.  From the title I deduce that the gates are supposed to be the subject but by their transparent nature they don''t really fill the role...TC', '2006-12-31 20:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
