(3167688, 443816, 5436, '<td valign="top">beautiful photo.</td>', 'beautiful photo.', '2007-01-01 15:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3167703, 441839, 64068, '<td valign="top">I think this is already a great picture.. however, I think it would look even better if the BG behind the man was the same (as if it was the same picture with three different zoom levels).. like: CITY&gt;&gt;closer&gt;WALL&gt;&gt;closer&gt;MAN</td>', 'I think this is already a great picture.. however, I think it would look even better if the BG behind the man was the same (as if it was the same picture with three different zoom levels).. like: CITY>>closer>WALL>>closer>MAN', '2007-01-01 16:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3167707, 443544, 66956, '<td valign="top">Awesome effect! What a typical child''s room especially after the holidays! You really captured the after-math of the holidays in this shot!</td>', 'Awesome effect! What a typical child''s room especially after the holidays! You really captured the after-math of the holidays in this shot!', '2007-01-01 16:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3167789, 443717, 12200, '<td valign="top">Why does this one remind me of something I''d see in National Geographic?</td>', 'Why does this one remind me of something I''d see in National Geographic?', '2007-01-01 17:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3167810, 442395, 12200, '<td valign="top">This is really nicely done. Really captures the essence of what separates digital photography from traditional photography as its own artform.</td>', 'This is really nicely done. Really captures the essence of what separates digital photography from traditional photography as its own artform.', '2007-01-01 17:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3167814, 443649, 12200, '<td valign="top">Is that Mr. Clean in the toilet? :-P Very clever.</td>', 'Is that Mr. Clean in the toilet? :-P Very clever.', '2007-01-01 17:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3167816, 443069, 12200, '<td valign="top">Extremely disturbing...a sure sign of an effective image.</td>', 'Extremely disturbing...a sure sign of an effective image.', '2007-01-01 17:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3167824, 443070, 12200, '<td valign="top">I want to live there.</td>', 'I want to live there.', '2007-01-01 17:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3167831, 443378, 12200, '<td valign="top">The clarity of this photo is amazing.</td>', 'The clarity of this photo is amazing.', '2007-01-01 17:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3167835, 443807, 12200, '<td valign="top">I think the shadow effect on this photo''s border detracts from its overall effectiveness. Might I suggest just a thin black border around the edge? The composition is otherwise amazing.</td>', 'I think the shadow effect on this photo''s border detracts from its overall effectiveness. Might I suggest just a thin black border around the edge? The composition is otherwise amazing.', '2007-01-01 17:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3167839, 441885, 12200, '<td valign="top">Another one that feels--for whatever reason--like a shot out of National Geographic. Excellent work.</td>', 'Another one that feels--for whatever reason--like a shot out of National Geographic. Excellent work.', '2007-01-01 17:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3167847, 443441, 12200, '<td valign="top">Incredible coloration.</td>', 'Incredible coloration.', '2007-01-01 17:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3167851, 442346, 67258, '<td valign="top">I have a problem voting on this one, as the elements of the photo clearly suggest a message - but it has all gone quite over the top of my head!</td>', 'I have a problem voting on this one, as the elements of the photo clearly suggest a message - but it has all gone quite over the top of my head!', '2007-01-01 17:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3167864, 442842, 12200, '<td valign="top">I think this is a fabulous photo, but I have to question the logic...I mean, it''s obvious that those are storm clouds, and yet this person is lying on parched land that obviously hasn''t seen rain in forever. I would think the storm clouds--usually an ominous sign--would here represent hope instead of desolation. I''d love to hear more about the story behind this photo. The incongruity is intriguing--but don''t worry, I''m not letting THAT affect my rating.</td>', 'I think this is a fabulous photo, but I have to question the logic...I mean, it''s obvious that those are storm clouds, and yet this person is lying on parched land that obviously hasn''t seen rain in forever. I would think the storm clouds--usually an ominous sign--would here represent hope instead of desolation. I''d love to hear more about the story behind this photo. The incongruity is intriguing--but don''t worry, I''m not letting THAT affect my rating.', '2007-01-01 17:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3167881, 442433, 12200, '<td valign="top">INCREDIBLE composition on this one. But I''m DYING for just a slightly tighter crop on the right side...I find the lines on the right side distracting... I have to give this one a 9 for its overall strength, but if I didn''t find my eyes drawn disproportionately to the right, I think this could easily be my favorite in the challenge so far.</td>', 'INCREDIBLE composition on this one. But I''m DYING for just a slightly tighter crop on the right side...I find the lines on the right side distracting... I have to give this one a 9 for its overall strength, but if I didn''t find my eyes drawn disproportionately to the right, I think this could easily be my favorite in the challenge so far.', '2007-01-01 17:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3167895, 442524, 12200, '<td valign="top">I love the gradient of this shot.</td>', 'I love the gradient of this shot.', '2007-01-01 18:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3167899, 442808, 12200, '<td valign="top">Creative...and political.</td>', 'Creative...and political.', '2007-01-01 18:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3167904, 442771, 12200, '<td valign="top">Nice macro effect. Very creative perspective for this challenge.</td>', 'Nice macro effect. Very creative perspective for this challenge.', '2007-01-01 18:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3167909, 443899, 12200, '<td valign="top">Too grainy. It may be on purpose, but it feels like a low resolution shot blown up too big.</td>', 'Too grainy. It may be on purpose, but it feels like a low resolution shot blown up too big.', '2007-01-01 18:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3167934, 443707, 12200, '<td valign="top">Man, I appreciate what you were trying to do with this, but the pond shot is so striking that it actually LOSES its beauty with those video-game-animation-looking zombies in the background. I feel as though the serene beauty of this place has been violated by an overpaid graphic designer. Forgive the harsh words, but perhaps you could experiment with the lighting or textures to make this look more like a true horror destination?</td>', 'Man, I appreciate what you were trying to do with this, but the pond shot is so striking that it actually LOSES its beauty with those video-game-animation-looking zombies in the background. I feel as though the serene beauty of this place has been violated by an overpaid graphic designer. Forgive the harsh words, but perhaps you could experiment with the lighting or textures to make this look more like a true horror destination?', '2007-01-01 18:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3167962, 443555, 12200, '<td valign="top">This one MIGHT (I''m not sure) be more striking in black and white.</td>', 'This one MIGHT (I''m not sure) be more striking in black and white.', '2007-01-01 18:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3168006, 443816, 12200, '<td valign="top">This is so very striking and clear. I love it.</td>', 'This is so very striking and clear. I love it.', '2007-01-01 18:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3168097, 443798, 60495, '<td valign="top">The picture has a certain harshness but but no real appeal in my opinion, sorry but all I see is a blown out center area that takes away from everything else in the photo.</td>', 'The picture has a certain harshness but but no real appeal in my opinion, sorry but all I see is a blown out center area that takes away from everything else in the photo.', '2007-01-01 19:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3168124, 443632, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is so funny I had to give tihs a 10.</td>', 'This is so funny I had to give tihs a 10.', '2007-01-01 19:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
