(3169572, 442823, 52439, '<td valign="top">There doesn''t seem to a much structure to this shot, it seems like you pointed it in the wrong direction. The main subject of the tree isn''t bad, but the layout just seems odd otherwise, and with all the tones almost the same it does look a little drab with little distinction between objects.</td>', 'There doesn''t seem to a much structure to this shot, it seems like you pointed it in the wrong direction. The main subject of the tree isn''t bad, but the layout just seems odd otherwise, and with all the tones almost the same it does look a little drab with little distinction between objects.', '2007-01-02 07:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169573, 443613, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well not bad but I have to put a ? about the processing here, looks like you neat imaged the heck out of this one since there is so little detail left in the faces of the guys and looks like the onions on the table were severely overexposed and then brought back in raw conversion.  Also some strong artefacting in their clothes, mostly in the shadow areas.  My suggestion would have to keep the noise in and make this black and white, that would eliminate the attention going to the red and yellow parts of the photos and be more about the guys and I find noise/grain quite acceptable in B/W.  Sorry but cause of the image quality/post processing and the snapshottish look of this image I voted it a 4.</td>', 'Well not bad but I have to put a ? about the processing here, looks like you neat imaged the heck out of this one since there is so little detail left in the faces of the guys and looks like the onions on the table were severely overexposed and then brought back in raw conversion.  Also some strong artefacting in their clothes, mostly in the shadow areas.  My suggestion would have to keep the noise in and make this black and white, that would eliminate the attention going to the red and yellow parts of the photos and be more about the guys and I find noise/grain quite acceptable in B/W.  Sorry but cause of the image quality/post processing and the snapshottish look of this image I voted it a 4.', '2007-01-02 07:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169574, 443910, 52439, '<td valign="top">After coming back 3 times i still can''t figure out what that is on the ''surface''. Intriguing shot though.</td>', 'After coming back 3 times i still can''t figure out what that is on the ''surface''. Intriguing shot though.', '2007-01-02 07:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
