(3169587, 443920, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, like the colors and contrast in this one.  Would have fixed the strong halo around the pier and horizon though if I were editing this but nothing that is really bothering me.  7</td>', 'Nice shot, like the colors and contrast in this one.  Would have fixed the strong halo around the pier and horizon though if I were editing this but nothing that is really bothering me.  7', '2007-01-02 07:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169591, 443716, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well all I can say is that "the land" looks familiar :)  A bit flat contrast wise for my taste but nothing that is really bothering me.</td>', 'Well all I can say is that "the land" looks familiar :)  A bit flat contrast wise for my taste but nothing that is really bothering me.', '2007-01-02 07:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169592, 442359, 27482, '<td valign="top">I am sorry but I have to say this, that sky looks horrible, whatever you did in post processing does not agree with me, for my taste it´s very oversaturated and "muddy".  The rest of the shot is OK though but still looks a bit oversaturated to me, the only part of the picture I am ok with the saturation is the grass, there it fit´s.  As for the composition, it´s not bad but I find that fence a bit distracting, I think I would have liked it better if you either went down to the ground and included all the fence having the house behind it or tilted the camera upwards, thus eliminating the fence alltogether and having more sky in the shot.  Sorry but this got a 4 from me.</td>', 'I am sorry but I have to say this, that sky looks horrible, whatever you did in post processing does not agree with me, for my taste it´s very oversaturated and "muddy".  The rest of the shot is OK though but still looks a bit oversaturated to me, the only part of the picture I am ok with the saturation is the grass, there it fit´s.  As for the composition, it´s not bad but I find that fence a bit distracting, I think I would have liked it better if you either went down to the ground and included all the fence having the house behind it or tilted the camera upwards, thus eliminating the fence alltogether and having more sky in the shot.  Sorry but this got a 4 from me.', '2007-01-02 07:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169598, 443891, 27482, '<td valign="top">Looks faimilar, is that you Cindi?  Hope your hubby treats you better in real life :)</td>', 'Looks faimilar, is that you Cindi?  Hope your hubby treats you better in real life :)', '2007-01-02 07:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169606, 443545, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well I like the DOF for starters and the blue hue to the shot.  What I don´t like is the composition, way to centered for my taste with too much space to the left and the leaf is a bit too bright for my taste, very close to blowing out highlights and doesn´t hold enough detail/texture for my taste.  6 from me.</td>', 'Well I like the DOF for starters and the blue hue to the shot.  What I don´t like is the composition, way to centered for my taste with too much space to the left and the leaf is a bit too bright for my taste, very close to blowing out highlights and doesn´t hold enough detail/texture for my taste.  6 from me.', '2007-01-02 07:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169612, 442686, 27482, '<td valign="top">I have been waiting for someone to do this kind of photography in these expert editing challenges and finally I found one :)  However, I encourage you to not forget the photographic side to post processing, like color tones, contrast and sharpness wich I find lacking here.  Normally photos like this get a 4-5 from me but I appreciate the effort involved and bumped it up to 6.  Had you had good image quality+better lighting along with the multiple guys (oh and I would have skipped the one in the lower right corner, he kindof steals unneccesary attention) this would definately be up there at the top in the challenge.  Keep at it!</td>', 'I have been waiting for someone to do this kind of photography in these expert editing challenges and finally I found one :)  However, I encourage you to not forget the photographic side to post processing, like color tones, contrast and sharpness wich I find lacking here.  Normally photos like this get a 4-5 from me but I appreciate the effort involved and bumped it up to 6.  Had you had good image quality+better lighting along with the multiple guys (oh and I would have skipped the one in the lower right corner, he kindof steals unneccesary attention) this would definately be up there at the top in the challenge.  Keep at it!', '2007-01-02 07:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169623, 443276, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad, I like the blue hue to the shot.  A shame about the area around the sun though, since you have expert editing available to you and you have an static subject you really should have put a bit more effort in this shot and done a double or more exposures and made sure you had that area in check.</td>', 'Not bad, I like the blue hue to the shot.  A shame about the area around the sun though, since you have expert editing available to you and you have an static subject you really should have put a bit more effort in this shot and done a double or more exposures and made sure you had that area in check.', '2007-01-02 07:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169632, 443445, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well this is neither good nor bad for me, don´t really know what else to say.  I like the sky, think you should have sharpened this more though as the whole image seems fuzzy.  5</td>', 'Well this is neither good nor bad for me, don´t really know what else to say.  I like the sky, think you should have sharpened this more though as the whole image seems fuzzy.  5', '2007-01-02 08:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169639, 442198, 27482, '<td valign="top">I totally love that sky but the rest of the shot, not so much.  Whatever you did to the mountain range and ground in post processing just makes it seem very flat constrast wise and reduces all detail and texture in it, just seems very poorly dodged/burned to me.  Still voted 6 though as I LOVE that sky, wish the rest of the image had been in similar quality.</td>', 'I totally love that sky but the rest of the shot, not so much.  Whatever you did to the mountain range and ground in post processing just makes it seem very flat constrast wise and reduces all detail and texture in it, just seems very poorly dodged/burned to me.  Still voted 6 though as I LOVE that sky, wish the rest of the image had been in similar quality.', '2007-01-02 08:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169789, 443918, 40355, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, I really like the sharpness of the rocks and the softness of the water.  The extreme sunlight isn''t necessarily a bad touch, but I feel that it is a bit too blown, and become more a distraction than an addition. 7</td>', 'Beautiful shot, I really like the sharpness of the rocks and the softness of the water.  The extreme sunlight isn''t necessarily a bad touch, but I feel that it is a bit too blown, and become more a distraction than an addition. 7', '2007-01-02 08:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169793, 443807, 40355, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, great contrast between colors.  Definetly a moody, cold feeling to this.  The shadowed border is neat, but I''m not sure it isn''t a little distracting.  8</td>', 'Beautiful shot, great contrast between colors.  Definetly a moody, cold feeling to this.  The shadowed border is neat, but I''m not sure it isn''t a little distracting.  8', '2007-01-02 09:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169799, 443830, 40355, '<td valign="top">Love the feeling of this, very dark and mysterious.  The silhouettes are captured VERY well, and the overall exposure and contrast is spot-on.  Well done!  10</td>', 'Love the feeling of this, very dark and mysterious.  The silhouettes are captured VERY well, and the overall exposure and contrast is spot-on.  Well done!  10', '2007-01-02 09:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169804, 443396, 40355, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors and tones here, very vivid without being overdone.  Good overall composition, interesting to study without being too busy.</td>', 'Wonderful colors and tones here, very vivid without being overdone.  Good overall composition, interesting to study without being too busy.', '2007-01-02 09:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169807, 443707, 40355, '<td valign="top">Or swamp of the living clones? ;-)  Well done, definetly has a creepy element, very well processed and merged.</td>', 'Or swamp of the living clones? ;-)  Well done, definetly has a creepy element, very well processed and merged.', '2007-01-02 09:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169843, 442686, 40355, '<td valign="top">Haha, very cute, and perhaps one of the harshest environments of all!  Well executed and composed.  The only issues I have are the lighting, which is a little flat, and the bottom center child, who''s looking right at the camera, which detracts from the shot a little.  7</td>', 'Haha, very cute, and perhaps one of the harshest environments of all!  Well executed and composed.  The only issues I have are the lighting, which is a little flat, and the bottom center child, who''s looking right at the camera, which detracts from the shot a little.  7', '2007-01-02 09:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169851, 443649, 40355, '<td valign="top">Priceless shot, both very funny and perfectly executed.  No contest, this is a 10</td>', 'Priceless shot, both very funny and perfectly executed.  No contest, this is a 10', '2007-01-02 09:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169854, 442700, 40355, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, love the range of terrain, from the fields to the mountain top.  The lightning is a nice touch, but it''s really the cloud bands that kick the shot up the most.  Very well done.  10</td>', 'Wonderful shot, love the range of terrain, from the fields to the mountain top.  The lightning is a nice touch, but it''s really the cloud bands that kick the shot up the most.  Very well done.  10', '2007-01-02 09:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169855, 441885, 13688, '<td valign="top">This photograph is a classic.  One of the most emotive shots I''ve ever seen submitted on this site. - 10</td>', 'This photograph is a classic.  One of the most emotive shots I''ve ever seen submitted on this site. - 10', '2007-01-02 09:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169906, 443548, 70375, '<td valign="top">I love this because of the dismembered arm laying over there by the cat that is looking at you like it wants to eat you :D Beautiful!</td>', 'I love this because of the dismembered arm laying over there by the cat that is looking at you like it wants to eat you :D Beautiful!', '2007-01-02 10:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169918, 443036, 70375, '<td valign="top">I love this processing! Some people are probably going to say it is too dark the the top right hand but, after I voted, I looked at this for a while before posting a comment... I must say, I think you got it just right... the dark really contrasts well with the lights filtering down onto the tree stump and snow bringing it forward... sorry this is so long :D BUT FABULOUS PHOTOGRAPH!</td>', 'I love this processing! Some people are probably going to say it is too dark the the top right hand but, after I voted, I looked at this for a while before posting a comment... I must say, I think you got it just right... the dark really contrasts well with the lights filtering down onto the tree stump and snow bringing it forward... sorry this is so long :D BUT FABULOUS PHOTOGRAPH!', '2007-01-02 10:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169933, 443544, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well I have sort of mixed feelings about this image.  On one hand, I like the "drawing like" look of the image, like it was drawn with a pencil.  On the other hand, it´s WAY too busy for my taste and my eyes have a hard time staying anywhere for more than a second.  I like the style but think it would be better suited to something simpler, like a human face or something.  I know, not what the challenge is about, I am simply encouraging you to try the same editing again if there is for instance an expert editing portrait challenge.  Ended up voting 5.</td>', 'Well I have sort of mixed feelings about this image.  On one hand, I like the "drawing like" look of the image, like it was drawn with a pencil.  On the other hand, it´s WAY too busy for my taste and my eyes have a hard time staying anywhere for more than a second.  I like the style but think it would be better suited to something simpler, like a human face or something.  I know, not what the challenge is about, I am simply encouraging you to try the same editing again if there is for instance an expert editing portrait challenge.  Ended up voting 5.', '2007-01-02 10:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169951, 443427, 51538, '<td valign="top">I like the simple image in which the photography and processing do not seem to get in the way of the viewing experience.  Nice work. 10.</td>', 'I like the simple image in which the photography and processing do not seem to get in the way of the viewing experience.  Nice work. 10.', '2007-01-02 10:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169954, 443816, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nature''s spotlight - it''s a lovely effect. 10.</td>', 'Nature''s spotlight - it''s a lovely effect. 10.', '2007-01-02 10:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169955, 443646, 51538, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and tones.  Exceptional location for these industrial silhouettes.  Keep up this good work. 10.</td>', 'Wonderful composition and tones.  Exceptional location for these industrial silhouettes.  Keep up this good work. 10.', '2007-01-02 10:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169956, 443613, 51538, '<td valign="top">Very good indeed.  Harsh conditions!</td>', 'Very good indeed.  Harsh conditions!', '2007-01-02 10:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169957, 443415, 51538, '<td valign="top">What an exceptional image.  As far as I can see, it is more or less as it came from the camera. 10.</td>', 'What an exceptional image.  As far as I can see, it is more or less as it came from the camera. 10.', '2007-01-02 10:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169960, 443490, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice industrial sculpture. 9.</td>', 'Nice industrial sculpture. 9.', '2007-01-02 10:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169961, 443509, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice terrain and view point.  It keeps me looking. 9.</td>', 'Nice terrain and view point.  It keeps me looking. 9.', '2007-01-02 10:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169962, 441885, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice work and good title. 9.</td>', 'Nice work and good title. 9.', '2007-01-02 10:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169964, 443749, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely classic feel to this photo. 9.</td>', 'Lovely classic feel to this photo. 9.', '2007-01-02 10:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169965, 443830, 51538, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites of the challenge. 9.</td>', 'One of my favourites of the challenge. 9.', '2007-01-02 10:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169968, 443068, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely the way the snow covers the tracks yet the profile is still revealed. 9.</td>', 'Lovely the way the snow covers the tracks yet the profile is still revealed. 9.', '2007-01-02 10:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169971, 443716, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely, exotic terrain.  Great view point. 10.</td>', 'Lovely, exotic terrain.  Great view point. 10.', '2007-01-02 10:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169974, 443070, 51538, '<td valign="top">Exquisite colour and shape on display. 9.</td>', 'Exquisite colour and shape on display. 9.', '2007-01-02 10:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169986, 443798, 41206, '<td valign="top">not sure what i am looking at, not sure what that white column is in the cener???</td>', 'not sure what i am looking at, not sure what that white column is in the cener???', '2007-01-02 10:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169994, 443547, 41206, '<td valign="top">If i only could read the pages of the book, if the image were closer, if the pages were muddy. Well lit, but I can''t see the theme of this image without the title. I will give you a 7 for creativity and lighting..</td>', 'If i only could read the pages of the book, if the image were closer, if the pages were muddy. Well lit, but I can''t see the theme of this image without the title. I will give you a 7 for creativity and lighting..', '2007-01-02 10:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169998, 443614, 41206, '<td valign="top">poorly lit, not in focus, flat, can''t see the bird well...a 2</td>', 'poorly lit, not in focus, flat, can''t see the bird well...a 2', '2007-01-02 10:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170003, 443920, 35947, '<td valign="top">Not crazy about the border but I love the coloring and perspective you give!</td>', 'Not crazy about the border but I love the coloring and perspective you give!', '2007-01-02 10:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170009, 441504, 40355, '<td valign="top">Some more definition in the fish would have made this even better.</td>', 'Some more definition in the fish would have made this even better.', '2007-01-02 10:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170097, 442771, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well the ground looks beliavable as a moon, so does the rock but the sky on the other hand is too gray (as in not black) for it to be really believable.  If I had done this image I would have gone out and taken star sky shot´s and used that as the sky, would have lead this image to be much more aesthetically pleasing.  Also the blur on the rocks close to the horizon is also giving it away, this would have infinity focus if it were a real photograph from the moon or the floating rock would also be blurry.  Nice effort, just needs better execution and your all set :)</td>', 'Well the ground looks beliavable as a moon, so does the rock but the sky on the other hand is too gray (as in not black) for it to be really believable.  If I had done this image I would have gone out and taken star sky shot´s and used that as the sky, would have lead this image to be much more aesthetically pleasing.  Also the blur on the rocks close to the horizon is also giving it away, this would have infinity focus if it were a real photograph from the moon or the floating rock would also be blurry.  Nice effort, just needs better execution and your all set :)', '2007-01-02 10:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170111, 443555, 27482, '<td valign="top">An ok shot, fit´s the challenge certainly but I have a hard time connecting to the subject without having a face there somewhere.</td>', 'An ok shot, fit´s the challenge certainly but I have a hard time connecting to the subject without having a face there somewhere.', '2007-01-02 10:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170118, 443708, 27482, '<td valign="top">A bit on the flat side contrast wise for my taste but nothing that´s really bothering me.  I do like the composition but have a feeling it would have been better if you had been standing on the left side of that trail, having it begin in thelower right corner and go up in the hills like it does here.  Did you take any shot´s like that?  Would like to see the comparision at least.  6 from me.</td>', 'A bit on the flat side contrast wise for my taste but nothing that´s really bothering me.  I do like the composition but have a feeling it would have been better if you had been standing on the left side of that trail, having it begin in thelower right corner and go up in the hills like it does here.  Did you take any shot´s like that?  Would like to see the comparision at least.  6 from me.', '2007-01-02 10:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170126, 442524, 27482, '<td valign="top">A nice shot but not quite enough for me to give a higher score than 6, just lacks that certain "wow" factor for me personally but absolutely nothing wrong with it.</td>', 'A nice shot but not quite enough for me to give a higher score than 6, just lacks that certain "wow" factor for me personally but absolutely nothing wrong with it.', '2007-01-02 11:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170140, 443415, 27482, '<td valign="top">This kindof makes me think of Cutter´s Triptych ribbon.  Anyway, a nice shot and pretty well captured, think I would have liked it better if the eagle had been in the upper right corner and not the left and I personally may even have gone so far as to move it since that´s allowed in the ruleset but I respect that you didn´t.  A small halo around the bird though that bothers me, you sure your monitor isn´t a little too bright?  Anyway, great shot, 7 from me.</td>', 'This kindof makes me think of Cutter´s Triptych ribbon.  Anyway, a nice shot and pretty well captured, think I would have liked it better if the eagle had been in the upper right corner and not the left and I personally may even have gone so far as to move it since that´s allowed in the ruleset but I respect that you didn´t.  A small halo around the bird though that bothers me, you sure your monitor isn´t a little too bright?  Anyway, great shot, 7 from me.', '2007-01-02 11:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170157, 443448, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well this is a cool concept but could stand to be better executed technically, specifically the fact that the girl is out of focus and has such wierd skintones and wierd texture in the face (wich I blame on the post processing, I think the girl is very cute of course).  I really like the idea and the distortion on the boy makes it really seem like he´s trapped in there.  Maybe some soap reflection on his bubble would perfect the illusion (I mean blue oilish reflection like is on her bubble)  6 from me.</td>', 'Well this is a cool concept but could stand to be better executed technically, specifically the fact that the girl is out of focus and has such wierd skintones and wierd texture in the face (wich I blame on the post processing, I think the girl is very cute of course).  I really like the idea and the distortion on the boy makes it really seem like he´s trapped in there.  Maybe some soap reflection on his bubble would perfect the illusion (I mean blue oilish reflection like is on her bubble)  6 from me.', '2007-01-02 11:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170162, 443509, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well certainly meet´s the challenge but I kindof feel like I am looking at a picture of really nothing since there is no main subject in the photo.  Still nice and got a 6 but just lacks a place for my eyes to stop.</td>', 'Well certainly meet´s the challenge but I kindof feel like I am looking at a picture of really nothing since there is no main subject in the photo.  Still nice and got a 6 but just lacks a place for my eyes to stop.', '2007-01-02 11:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170168, 443625, 40355, '<td valign="top">Wonderful PS skills, it looks very real, with good lighting and blending.  10</td>', 'Wonderful PS skills, it looks very real, with good lighting and blending.  10', '2007-01-02 11:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170171, 443547, 27482, '<td valign="top">This one I like.  Great texture and exposure and environment.  Only thing I really dislike is the addition of BOTH vignettign and a frame, I think that´s a bit redundant and would have preferred this entry with only either but still one of the effects.  Anyway, one of the best in the challenge as far as I am concerned, gave it an 8.</td>', 'This one I like.  Great texture and exposure and environment.  Only thing I really dislike is the addition of BOTH vignettign and a frame, I think that´s a bit redundant and would have preferred this entry with only either but still one of the effects.  Anyway, one of the best in the challenge as far as I am concerned, gave it an 8.', '2007-01-02 11:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170191, 443707, 47933, '<td valign="top">Good idea, nice photography and processing work indeed. The only things stopping me from giving a 10 here is the hand is a different color than the face and it looks just a bit unnatural on the tip of the forefinger. Overall the image is fantastic. 9 from me.<br/> <br/>I loved you in "American Pie" also!</td>', 'Good idea, nice photography and processing work indeed. The only things stopping me from giving a 10 here is the hand is a different color than the face and it looks just a bit unnatural on the tip of the forefinger. Overall the image is fantastic. 9 from me. I loved you in "American Pie" also!', '2007-01-02 11:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170556, 443916, 53243, '<td valign="top">Nice conceptual photo for a not so nice place - it''s definitely the harshest environment I can think of.</td>', 'Nice conceptual photo for a not so nice place - it''s definitely the harshest environment I can think of.', '2007-01-02 12:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
