(3170664, 443396, 53243, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, and it''s representation, but I''m not sure why you choice the title.  I see it on the boxcar, but I can''t make the connection - do you hate the work because it''s harsh or you hate the Canadian Pacific Railway for having harsh work environments?</td>', 'I like the photo, and it''s representation, but I''m not sure why you choice the title.  I see it on the boxcar, but I can''t make the connection - do you hate the work because it''s harsh or you hate the Canadian Pacific Railway for having harsh work environments?', '2007-01-02 12:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
