(3171805, 443801, 9906, '<td valign="top">LOL...  I didn''t even see the cat till I came back to comment on the shot.  This is not exactly a photogenic scene, but fits the challenge well and doesn''t seem to be overly manipulated like some...<br/>TC</td>', 'LOL...  I didn''t even see the cat till I came back to comment on the shot.  This is not exactly a photogenic scene, but fits the challenge well and doesn''t seem to be overly manipulated like some...TC', '2007-01-02 17:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171812, 443620, 9906, '<td valign="top">Like the lines in this.  Definatly fits the challenge.  Only thing I don''t like and could be fixed easily I''m told (I never could figure it out...)j is the perspective.  It''s not fish eye off which would actually look good, it''s annoying off.  If you don''t know what I mean, it''s how the building looks like it''s leaning in on itself...<br/>TC</td>', 'Like the lines in this.  Definatly fits the challenge.  Only thing I don''t like and could be fixed easily I''m told (I never could figure it out...)j is the perspective.  It''s not fish eye off which would actually look good, it''s annoying off.  If you don''t know what I mean, it''s how the building looks like it''s leaning in on itself...TC', '2007-01-02 17:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171815, 441874, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple!  Nothing blown out which is always a good thing.  Background could be a bit less blah in color but it is what it is.<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice and simple!  Nothing blown out which is always a good thing.  Background could be a bit less blah in color but it is what it is.TC', '2007-01-02 17:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
