(3171823, 443490, 9906, '<td valign="top">This looks like it is just a tad crooked.  Could be the perspective though...<br/>TC</td>', 'This looks like it is just a tad crooked.  Could be the perspective though...TC', '2007-01-02 17:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171827, 443273, 9906, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why, but something just doesn''t look right about this shot.  I''ve come back 4 or 5 times to try and figure it out but can''t.  I THINK it''s the harsh shadow going right up the center of the shot and enveloping the main subject.<br/>TC</td>', 'I don''t know why, but something just doesn''t look right about this shot.  I''ve come back 4 or 5 times to try and figure it out but can''t.  I THINK it''s the harsh shadow going right up the center of the shot and enveloping the main subject.TC', '2007-01-02 17:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171838, 443566, 9906, '<td valign="top">Several things seem to be a little off in this one.  The skin tones on the model are just a bit too redish/pinkish.  (I hate skin tones myself...)  The composition looks a litte awkward.  The model isn''t on a third line or centered but just a bit off from center.  This may look more natural if he weren''t looking out of the frame.  I''m assuming that you placed him in this position to capture the moonbuggy in the shot.  Turning him the other way may have helped...<br/>TC</td>', 'Several things seem to be a little off in this one.  The skin tones on the model are just a bit too redish/pinkish.  (I hate skin tones myself...)  The composition looks a litte awkward.  The model isn''t on a third line or centered but just a bit off from center.  This may look more natural if he weren''t looking out of the frame.  I''m assuming that you placed him in this position to capture the moonbuggy in the shot.  Turning him the other way may have helped...TC', '2007-01-02 17:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171843, 443613, 5746, '<td valign="top">Wonderfull sense of humor :) Just commenting. No voting.</td>', 'Wonderfull sense of humor :) Just commenting. No voting.', '2007-01-02 17:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171845, 442472, 9906, '<td valign="top">There is not enough interest in just the pieces of whatever it is by themselves.  They don''t hold my eye or allow it to land anywhere.  Your focus is VERY narrow which doesn''t help out any.<br/>TC</td>', 'There is not enough interest in just the pieces of whatever it is by themselves.  They don''t hold my eye or allow it to land anywhere.  Your focus is VERY narrow which doesn''t help out any.TC', '2007-01-02 17:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171852, 442771, 9906, '<td valign="top">There is stuff in your background that you can almost but not quite see and that is to me very distracting.  There also is no true black which looks kind of wierd for this type of shot.<br/>TC</td>', 'There is stuff in your background that you can almost but not quite see and that is to me very distracting.  There also is no true black which looks kind of wierd for this type of shot.TC', '2007-01-02 17:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
