(3171860, 443380, 9906, '<td valign="top">Was this shot at an airshow?  It doesn''t do anything for me.  It almosts looks like you randomly took a shot pointed in the sky.  There is no cool clouds or detail in the planes to give this any oomph.  It''s also very grainy which makes me wonder if it''s a very tight crop of an even bigger open boring sky...<br/>TC</td>', 'Was this shot at an airshow?  It doesn''t do anything for me.  It almosts looks like you randomly took a shot pointed in the sky.  There is no cool clouds or detail in the planes to give this any oomph.  It''s also very grainy which makes me wonder if it''s a very tight crop of an even bigger open boring sky...TC', '2007-01-02 17:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171864, 443805, 9906, '<td valign="top">A close up of a strawberry doesn''t really fit the description of an environment now does it?  Oh and the right side of your frame is thicker than the left side of your frame.  I really don''t like that...<br/>TC</td>', 'A close up of a strawberry doesn''t really fit the description of an environment now does it?  Oh and the right side of your frame is thicker than the left side of your frame.  I really don''t like that...TC', '2007-01-02 17:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
