(3181771, 441885, 66348, '<td valign="top">Great shot, well lit, love the story you can put in here. I would think harsh but it looks like he has a diamond belt. Lol...Love the softness on the skin and your composition. Nice work.</td>', 'Great shot, well lit, love the story you can put in here. I would think harsh but it looks like he has a diamond belt. Lol...Love the softness on the skin and your composition. Nice work.', '2007-01-04 17:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181772, 443676, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is one of those shots that I can''t wait to see how it was processed.  Did you use HDR?  I am a little confused by what appears to be a desaturated sky but a color reflection in the window.  Nice entry for the challenge.<br/>TC</td>', 'This is one of those shots that I can''t wait to see how it was processed.  Did you use HDR?  I am a little confused by what appears to be a desaturated sky but a color reflection in the window.  Nice entry for the challenge.TC', '2007-01-04 17:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
