(3181783, 443490, 66201, '<td valign="top">My second favourite in this challenge. This is so bleak and ABSOLUTE in it''s freezing harshness. Lovely control with the processing as well.</td>', 'My second favourite in this challenge. This is so bleak and ABSOLUTE in it''s freezing harshness. Lovely control with the processing as well.', '2007-01-04 17:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181789, 443545, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very simple shot.  Nice bokey.  Looks a little too blue for some reason but I don''t know what time of day it was shot or the background.  Just ''looks'' too blue...<br/>TC</td>', 'Very simple shot.  Nice bokey.  Looks a little too blue for some reason but I don''t know what time of day it was shot or the background.  Just ''looks'' too blue...TC', '2007-01-04 17:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
