(3181804, 443427, 173, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and angle. Truly a sign of our times (i.e. sprawl and development). I would have liked the piece of equipment to be highlighted some and maybe some adjustments on the contrast, otherwise nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot and angle. Truly a sign of our times (i.e. sprawl and development). I would have liked the piece of equipment to be highlighted some and maybe some adjustments on the contrast, otherwise nice shot.', '2007-01-04 17:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181806, 442590, 9906, '<td valign="top">This looks a little awkward to me.  I think it is because there is too much foreground and not enough sky.  I think you could have benefited from a little more depth in your focus or a focus point that is deeper into the shot.  You have what looks like a path leading to an object that is not quite sharp but not quite background blurry if you know what I''m trying to say...<br/>TC</td>', 'This looks a little awkward to me.  I think it is because there is too much foreground and not enough sky.  I think you could have benefited from a little more depth in your focus or a focus point that is deeper into the shot.  You have what looks like a path leading to an object that is not quite sharp but not quite background blurry if you know what I''m trying to say...TC', '2007-01-04 17:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181810, 442808, 66348, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot, love the planet effect. Well done.</td>', 'Sweet shot, love the planet effect. Well done.', '2007-01-04 17:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181816, 443378, 9906, '<td valign="top">Harsh environment indeed but not really an interesting shot.  Nothing to really hold the viewers attention.  I think your choice of border color is also a little distracting.  I think a darker gray or pure black would have added more to the moodiness...<br/>TC</td>', 'Harsh environment indeed but not really an interesting shot.  Nothing to really hold the viewers attention.  I think your choice of border color is also a little distracting.  I think a darker gray or pure black would have added more to the moodiness...TC', '2007-01-04 17:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
