(3181824, 443592, 9906, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit oversaturated but not horribly so.  Just enough to make the ground look odd against the blown out sky.  I think I would have cloned out the little car next to the house to give it a little more of a deserted feel but that''s just me.<br/>TC</td>', 'Looks a bit oversaturated but not horribly so.  Just enough to make the ground look odd against the blown out sky.  I think I would have cloned out the little car next to the house to give it a little more of a deserted feel but that''s just me.TC', '2007-01-04 17:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181833, 443599, 9906, '<td valign="top">Not exactly what I would call a harsh environment.  Wonder why it didn''t get towed...  There are a couple of what look like dust spots on the windshield that I would have cloned out to give it a more solid black but that''s just me.<br/>TC</td>', 'Not exactly what I would call a harsh environment.  Wonder why it didn''t get towed...  There are a couple of what look like dust spots on the windshield that I would have cloned out to give it a more solid black but that''s just me.TC', '2007-01-04 17:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
