(3181867, 442808, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well sort of nicely done, I would have added some stars in the sky though since you are going this far with the editing but well, saw a couple of shots like this in the last expert editing challenge that finished well and it kindof takes away the wow factor and makes it a bit redundant and I liked the two top 10 finishers in that challenge better than this, voted a 6.</td>', 'Well sort of nicely done, I would have added some stars in the sky though since you are going this far with the editing but well, saw a couple of shots like this in the last expert editing challenge that finished well and it kindof takes away the wow factor and makes it a bit redundant and I liked the two top 10 finishers in that challenge better than this, voted a 6.', '2007-01-04 17:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
