(3181872, 443427, 27482, '<td valign="top">I personally would have voted this higher if the sky hadn´t been so saturated, when I want really strong colors I usually increase the contrast or fiddle with curves instead of the saturation bar but that´s just my taste :)  I do not not think it´s a bad shot though but not good either so I voted a 5.</td>', 'I personally would have voted this higher if the sky hadn´t been so saturated, when I want really strong colors I usually increase the contrast or fiddle with curves instead of the saturation bar but that´s just my taste :)  I do not not think it´s a bad shot though but not good either so I voted a 5.', '2007-01-04 17:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181875, 443920, 66348, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, nice use of the border. Colors and contrast are great. Nice work.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, nice use of the border. Colors and contrast are great. Nice work.', '2007-01-04 17:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181882, 443440, 66348, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, this would have been a great pattern shot also. Nice composition and view.</td>', 'Nice shot, this would have been a great pattern shot also. Nice composition and view.', '2007-01-04 17:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181883, 443863, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well I voted this a 5 and no, not cause of some shock value wich I am sure some prissies will complain about or not cause it´s "disgusting", I have seen far worse and couldn´t care less.  I just don´t think this photo is well, more than a snapshot and neither good nor bad.  Since this challenge was titled harsh environments I would rather have taken a shot really down low by the animal (racoon? not sure what it is) and maybe shot it with a long exposure showing cars whizzing by to make it much more interesting.  Shot from above like this just gives me that snapshot feeling I was talking about earlier.</td>', 'Well I voted this a 5 and no, not cause of some shock value wich I am sure some prissies will complain about or not cause it´s "disgusting", I have seen far worse and couldn´t care less.  I just don´t think this photo is well, more than a snapshot and neither good nor bad.  Since this challenge was titled harsh environments I would rather have taken a shot really down low by the animal (racoon? not sure what it is) and maybe shot it with a long exposure showing cars whizzing by to make it much more interesting.  Shot from above like this just gives me that snapshot feeling I was talking about earlier.', '2007-01-04 17:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181885, 441504, 27482, '<td valign="top">Lol!  Love the expression on the fish :)  Don´t as much care for the cyan hue to this shot but nothing that is really bothering me, gave it a 7.</td>', 'Lol!  Love the expression on the fish :)  Don´t as much care for the cyan hue to this shot but nothing that is really bothering me, gave it a 7.', '2007-01-04 17:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
