(3181900, 443357, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well to be totally honest I don´t care for the "sky" part of the photo, I cant make it out and whatever it is it´s just way too busy for my taste and just steals all my attention away from what I assume you intended as the main subject, the house.  Also, even though I LOVE high contrast in images I think for my taste you went a little overboard here.  Voted a 4, just not to my taste.</td>', 'Well to be totally honest I don´t care for the "sky" part of the photo, I cant make it out and whatever it is it´s just way too busy for my taste and just steals all my attention away from what I assume you intended as the main subject, the house.  Also, even though I LOVE high contrast in images I think for my taste you went a little overboard here.  Voted a 4, just not to my taste.', '2007-01-04 17:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
