(3181951, 443755, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but something about the look of this image just doesn´t agree with me, I can´t put my finger on it but the cartoonish coloring along with the low contrast, I dunno, just not my cup of tea, sorry :(</td>', 'Sorry but something about the look of this image just doesn´t agree with me, I can´t put my finger on it but the cartoonish coloring along with the low contrast, I dunno, just not my cup of tea, sorry :(', '2007-01-04 17:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181955, 442823, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well don´t really know what to say about this shot, I find it neither good nor bad.  Like the blue toning, dislike the halo around the tree.  5 from me.</td>', 'Well don´t really know what to say about this shot, I find it neither good nor bad.  Like the blue toning, dislike the halo around the tree.  5 from me.', '2007-01-04 17:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182004, 443707, 27482, '<td valign="top">Alex, is that your brother?  Dig the shot, nice work, two things though, I would have had your brother wear a shirt or different clothes on the three photos of him in the backround to well maybe make it more realistic that they were three different people and also the hand creeping out of the frame has a much yellower skin tone than the face and that kindof bothers me.  Anyway, other than an awesome shot definately one of the best in the challenge :)</td>', 'Alex, is that your brother?  Dig the shot, nice work, two things though, I would have had your brother wear a shirt or different clothes on the three photos of him in the backround to well maybe make it more realistic that they were three different people and also the hand creeping out of the frame has a much yellower skin tone than the face and that kindof bothers me.  Anyway, other than an awesome shot definately one of the best in the challenge :)', '2007-01-04 17:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182011, 442368, 27482, '<td valign="top">I do like this shot but feel that something is missing.  Maybe the fact that I feel like I am looing at the top half of a photograh, I have a feeling I would have liked it better to see a portrait shot of the whole tree, dunno...  6</td>', 'I do like this shot but feel that something is missing.  Maybe the fact that I feel like I am looing at the top half of a photograh, I have a feeling I would have liked it better to see a portrait shot of the whole tree, dunno...  6', '2007-01-04 17:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182013, 443548, 15574, '<td valign="top">Would have found this a lot more interesting w/out the animals, I really like the arm to the right though.</td>', 'Would have found this a lot more interesting w/out the animals, I really like the arm to the right though.', '2007-01-04 18:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182020, 443706, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well three things bother me with this shot and made me vote a 3.  The first and smallest thing is that there is no face in this shot to make me identify with anyone.  Then I dislike the image quality, fisrt the color noise, most visible in the hands and then the selective desaturation, most visibleon the brown cap and blue jacket towards the tops.<br/> <br/>Thirdly and this is the big thing, that backround just really looks fake and unreal and just doesn´t do it for me, sorry :(</td>', 'Well three things bother me with this shot and made me vote a 3.  The first and smallest thing is that there is no face in this shot to make me identify with anyone.  Then I dislike the image quality, fisrt the color noise, most visible in the hands and then the selective desaturation, most visibleon the brown cap and blue jacket towards the tops. Thirdly and this is the big thing, that backround just really looks fake and unreal and just doesn´t do it for me, sorry :(', '2007-01-04 18:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182035, 442395, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well, I have seen <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=332" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">arnit</a>do similar stuff but they work much better in my opinion cause all of them are with the same color tone and hue and no black and white inbetween, that´s what mostly bothers me with it, also the fact that some of the squares are not really squares at all but have an odd shape, this just seems so chaotic and poorly though out if you pardon me for saying so while his collages of pictures look more organized and well laid out.  Not bad though but not good either, makes the image too busy for my taste and I voted a 5.</td>', 'Well, I have seen  arnitdo similar stuff but they work much better in my opinion cause all of them are with the same color tone and hue and no black and white inbetween, that´s what mostly bothers me with it, also the fact that some of the squares are not really squares at all but have an odd shape, this just seems so chaotic and poorly though out if you pardon me for saying so while his collages of pictures look more organized and well laid out.  Not bad though but not good either, makes the image too busy for my taste and I voted a 5.', '2007-01-04 18:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182040, 443277, 27482, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition here and use of color (or lack of color more rather, hehe)  7</td>', 'I really like the composition here and use of color (or lack of color more rather, hehe)  7', '2007-01-04 18:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182056, 443749, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well maybe it´s cause I have taken photos in a real blizzard several times and know what photos in them usually look like but this just screams "fake" to me when I opened the shot.  I still like it though, don´t get me wrong and I really dig the composition.  You probably know this though and while it doesn´t bother me, blwon highlights/white areas with little texture usually draws negative scores and comments here at DPC so if you are new, keep that in mind, people can be very anal about blown highlights here.  8 from me.</td>', 'Well maybe it´s cause I have taken photos in a real blizzard several times and know what photos in them usually look like but this just screams "fake" to me when I opened the shot.  I still like it though, don´t get me wrong and I really dig the composition.  You probably know this though and while it doesn´t bother me, blwon highlights/white areas with little texture usually draws negative scores and comments here at DPC so if you are new, keep that in mind, people can be very anal about blown highlights here.  8 from me.', '2007-01-04 18:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182059, 443068, 27482, '<td valign="top">I really dig this shot, not much more I can say but not enough for a 10 though, something missing for that but good enough for 9 from me and I am picky :)</td>', 'I really dig this shot, not much more I can say but not enough for a 10 though, something missing for that but good enough for 9 from me and I am picky :)', '2007-01-04 18:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182077, 442842, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well this is nice, I almost want to guess this is Gary´s work but processing not quite up to his usual level so if it is your´s, you got a little sloppy this time.  Mainly the shadows and burning around the man give it away and the "a little over the top" sky and sunlight also not quite 100% to my taste.  I still like this image a lot and gave it a 7 so don´t get me wrong and if this isn´t Gary, then at least I compared you to Kiwiness and that can´t be all bad :)</td>', 'Well this is nice, I almost want to guess this is Gary´s work but processing not quite up to his usual level so if it is your´s, you got a little sloppy this time.  Mainly the shadows and burning around the man give it away and the "a little over the top" sky and sunlight also not quite 100% to my taste.  I still like this image a lot and gave it a 7 so don´t get me wrong and if this isn´t Gary, then at least I compared you to Kiwiness and that can´t be all bad :)', '2007-01-04 18:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182096, 443601, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, lighting is ok and the backround is kindof cool, wish you had done a bit better job with the masking though as the top of their heads hairlines give it away but that´s just nitpicking :)</td>', 'Nice shot, lighting is ok and the backround is kindof cool, wish you had done a bit better job with the masking though as the top of their heads hairlines give it away but that´s just nitpicking :)', '2007-01-04 18:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182104, 443394, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well sorry but compared to most other entries in this challenge this just lacks that certain wow factor.  Maybe a more interesting sky, stronger contrast and in color this would work better, also the composition isn´t really doing anything for me, the foreground is too big a part of this photo for my taste. 4 from me.</td>', 'Well sorry but compared to most other entries in this challenge this just lacks that certain wow factor.  Maybe a more interesting sky, stronger contrast and in color this would work better, also the composition isn´t really doing anything for me, the foreground is too big a part of this photo for my taste. 4 from me.', '2007-01-04 18:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182116, 443625, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well this is good, nice job with the processing.  Two things though that bother me.  First is the lighting on the foreground, it comes from a wrong direction on the red rocks that are in the front part of the photo and I would suggest darkening them.  The other is the very slight movement of the stars, I either want them stationary or with very definitive startrails and this is somewhere in between but that´s just my personal preference.  I like this outcome though and gave it a 7.</td>', 'Well this is good, nice job with the processing.  Two things though that bother me.  First is the lighting on the foreground, it comes from a wrong direction on the red rocks that are in the front part of the photo and I would suggest darkening them.  The other is the very slight movement of the stars, I either want them stationary or with very definitive startrails and this is somewhere in between but that´s just my personal preference.  I like this outcome though and gave it a 7.', '2007-01-04 18:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182122, 442686, 32644, '<td valign="top">This is too funny! Looks like ''all'' your kids had a great time posing for this shot.</td>', 'This is too funny! Looks like ''all'' your kids had a great time posing for this shot.', '2007-01-04 18:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182145, 443663, 5112, '<td valign="top">Way overdone, it looks tonemapped to death, to my eyes at least.  I realize this style is popular now, and that everyone is doing this sort of thing, but maybe it would work better if it were just a bit subtler.  The only thing that catches attention here is the processing, the photo by itself is rather bland.  ~3</td>', 'Way overdone, it looks tonemapped to death, to my eyes at least.  I realize this style is popular now, and that everyone is doing this sort of thing, but maybe it would work better if it were just a bit subtler.  The only thing that catches attention here is the processing, the photo by itself is rather bland.  ~3', '2007-01-04 18:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182166, 442359, 5112, '<td valign="top">I think the concept is great, and the location has a lot of potential, but the treatment is way too over the top IMO.  It looks way too unreal, with all those bright colours and whatever.  ~4</td>', 'I think the concept is great, and the location has a lot of potential, but the treatment is way too over the top IMO.  It looks way too unreal, with all those bright colours and whatever.  ~4', '2007-01-04 18:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182169, 443636, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well it´s a nice shot but nothing really that strikes me, I voted a 5 as I find it neither bad nor good.</td>', 'Well it´s a nice shot but nothing really that strikes me, I voted a 5 as I find it neither bad nor good.', '2007-01-04 18:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182180, 442197, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well this is a shot that I say is neither bad nor good but two things dragged it a bit under 5.  Usually I don´t really mind blown out highlights but here it kindof steals attention from the main subject, the basket.  Secondly, the composition is hardly horrible but too centered for my taste, a shot wich had placed it better in the frame, perhaps according to the rule of thirds would have appealed more to me.  4 from me.</td>', 'Well this is a shot that I say is neither bad nor good but two things dragged it a bit under 5.  Usually I don´t really mind blown out highlights but here it kindof steals attention from the main subject, the basket.  Secondly, the composition is hardly horrible but too centered for my taste, a shot wich had placed it better in the frame, perhaps according to the rule of thirds would have appealed more to me.  4 from me.', '2007-01-04 18:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182193, 442856, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well sure, meets the challenge, no doubt.  However, the lighting is what´s bothers me most, the obvious and harsh flash lighting to be specific.  I see it´s shot in a cave (wich I find hard to believe, fern´s need sunlight to survive but whatever...) but that´s no excuse since your subject is stationary.  A tripod, longer shutter and softer lighting coming from some angle than on camera would dramatically have improved this shot :)  4 from me.</td>', 'Well sure, meets the challenge, no doubt.  However, the lighting is what´s bothers me most, the obvious and harsh flash lighting to be specific.  I see it´s shot in a cave (wich I find hard to believe, fern´s need sunlight to survive but whatever...) but that´s no excuse since your subject is stationary.  A tripod, longer shutter and softer lighting coming from some angle than on camera would dramatically have improved this shot :)  4 from me.', '2007-01-04 18:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182197, 443427, 5112, '<td valign="top">Strange contrast between the barren land and the bright blue sky.  It''s like, harsh but not harsh.  If the emphasis was on the "nothing shall grow", I wonder if showing more of the barren land would have worked - as it is, it doens''t say that much (to me).  ~4</td>', 'Strange contrast between the barren land and the bright blue sky.  It''s like, harsh but not harsh.  If the emphasis was on the "nothing shall grow", I wonder if showing more of the barren land would have worked - as it is, it doens''t say that much (to me).  ~4', '2007-01-04 18:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182207, 443921, 5112, '<td valign="top">on the edge?  :)  Pity you couldn''t avoid the power lines.  Good idea.  ~6</td>', 'on the edge?  :)  Pity you couldn''t avoid the power lines.  Good idea.  ~6', '2007-01-04 18:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182215, 442276, 27482, '<td valign="top">I never really pay much attention to titles and I needed it to figure out what the deal was with this picture, that there was a flame there, I just thought it was a bush in red autum colors.  Anyway, that portion of the shot is too small a part of the shot and doesn´t draw enough of my attention to it, for my taste anyway.  Honestly my eye more wanders to the red grass or plants in the bottom of the middle of the shot.  I would have framed it more tightly around the flames and composed it on the rule of thirds point in the upper left corner.  5 from me.</td>', 'I never really pay much attention to titles and I needed it to figure out what the deal was with this picture, that there was a flame there, I just thought it was a bush in red autum colors.  Anyway, that portion of the shot is too small a part of the shot and doesn´t draw enough of my attention to it, for my taste anyway.  Honestly my eye more wanders to the red grass or plants in the bottom of the middle of the shot.  I would have framed it more tightly around the flames and composed it on the rule of thirds point in the upper left corner.  5 from me.', '2007-01-04 18:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182219, 443830, 5112, '<td valign="top">It''s difficult for me to think of this as harsh, it is so inviting :)  It is, however, a beautiful image.  I wonder if getting in a bit closer (no sky, no branches intruding at the left) would also work.  Those silhouettes are great.  ~7</td>', 'It''s difficult for me to think of this as harsh, it is so inviting :)  It is, however, a beautiful image.  I wonder if getting in a bit closer (no sky, no branches intruding at the left) would also work.  Those silhouettes are great.  ~7', '2007-01-04 18:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182224, 442940, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but since you went this way and did a shot like this I can´t help but compare it to the two similar shot´s that finished in the top 10 of the sky challenge and frankly this is not nearly as well done.  Mostly what bothers me is the fuzzyness of the trees, the fact that they are cut off on the right and left side and the lackof detail and texture in it.  You probably think I voted 1 with that comment but well it´s not bad at all though, just not good either so I voted 5 :)</td>', 'Sorry but since you went this way and did a shot like this I can´t help but compare it to the two similar shot´s that finished in the top 10 of the sky challenge and frankly this is not nearly as well done.  Mostly what bothers me is the fuzzyness of the trees, the fact that they are cut off on the right and left side and the lackof detail and texture in it.  You probably think I voted 1 with that comment but well it´s not bad at all though, just not good either so I voted 5 :)', '2007-01-04 18:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182259, 443806, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well not a bad shot but kindof flat contrast wise for my taste and not really anything I haven´t seen before but that´s just me and I live by the sea so I need more than that to be impressed.  Voted a 5.</td>', 'Well not a bad shot but kindof flat contrast wise for my taste and not really anything I haven´t seen before but that´s just me and I live by the sea so I need more than that to be impressed.  Voted a 5.', '2007-01-04 18:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182262, 443555, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good candid, good entry.  Looks like it might have been NeatImaged a bit too strongly.  ~6</td>', 'Good candid, good entry.  Looks like it might have been NeatImaged a bit too strongly.  ~6', '2007-01-04 18:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182268, 442842, 5112, '<td valign="top">The person looks like they are floating :)  Very dramatic sky.</td>', 'The person looks like they are floating :)  Very dramatic sky.', '2007-01-04 18:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182274, 442112, 5112, '<td valign="top">Scary!</td>', 'Scary!', '2007-01-04 18:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182276, 443918, 27482, '<td valign="top">I really dig this shot, very minimalistic and "clean".  Should most definately have put it up in 700 pixles though, that would have hurt your score and you are probably aware of this but just in case you are new here blown highlights doesn´t do well with DPC voters here.  They don´t bother me in the least in this shot though, I actually like the strong light coming from the center.  8 from me.</td>', 'I really dig this shot, very minimalistic and "clean".  Should most definately have put it up in 700 pixles though, that would have hurt your score and you are probably aware of this but just in case you are new here blown highlights doesn´t do well with DPC voters here.  They don´t bother me in the least in this shot though, I actually like the strong light coming from the center.  8 from me.', '2007-01-04 18:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182281, 442857, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well this shot would have appealed so much more to me if there was some detail left in that skull, usually I don´t care about blown highlights but when it´s so far gone as in this picture...  Sorry but the image quality is just not for me, gave it a 3.</td>', 'Well this shot would have appealed so much more to me if there was some detail left in that skull, usually I don´t care about blown highlights but when it´s so far gone as in this picture...  Sorry but the image quality is just not for me, gave it a 3.', '2007-01-04 18:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182282, 442940, 5112, '<td valign="top">It seems to me this is quite nicely done, although I sort of wish the trees weren''t cut off at the edges on both sides.  It is not my style I must say, and I''m not sure I would have made the connection if it weren''t for the title.  ~6</td>', 'It seems to me this is quite nicely done, although I sort of wish the trees weren''t cut off at the edges on both sides.  It is not my style I must say, and I''m not sure I would have made the connection if it weren''t for the title.  ~6', '2007-01-04 18:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182285, 443632, 62309, '<td valign="top">IMP</td>', 'IMP', '2007-01-04 18:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182286, 443509, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light spot on the mountains in the distance!  ~7</td>', 'Beautiful light spot on the mountains in the distance!  ~7', '2007-01-04 18:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182294, 443544, 5112, '<td valign="top">YIKES!</td>', 'YIKES!', '2007-01-04 18:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182334, 442312, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well I always am demanding on photos of fire and want to see clear cut texture and detail in them and not blown out, this is close but not quite there.  Not bad though but I demand better :)</td>', 'Well I always am demanding on photos of fire and want to see clear cut texture and detail in them and not blown out, this is close but not quite there.  Not bad though but I demand better :)', '2007-01-04 18:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182343, 443807, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well I bet you are getting hammered for the frame and I must say, understandably so.  I usually never complain about frames but this one does nothing than draw attention from what I consider a pretty good photograph.  I like the shot, excellent tones in it and love the subtle colors.  7</td>', 'Well I bet you are getting hammered for the frame and I must say, understandably so.  I usually never complain about frames but this one does nothing than draw attention from what I consider a pretty good photograph.  I like the shot, excellent tones in it and love the subtle colors.  7', '2007-01-04 18:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182351, 443625, 5112, '<td valign="top">Excellent work!  (no vote)</td>', 'Excellent work!  (no vote)', '2007-01-04 18:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182359, 443891, 5112, '<td valign="top">Yikes, this is scary!</td>', 'Yikes, this is scary!', '2007-01-04 18:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182425, 442521, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well three things that I dislike about this shot. <br/> <br/>1.  The black top and bottom just don´t make sense to me, don´t really care for them.<br/> <br/>2.  The seagull looks totally fake and out of place, don´t get why you put it there.<br/> <br/>3.  The selective blurring, especially on the left side of the photo are not making this a better photo in my opinion.<br/> <br/>I do like the grain and coloring and the look of the image though and voted a 6 in spite of all three issues I have with this shot.</td>', 'Well three things that I dislike about this shot.  1.  The black top and bottom just don´t make sense to me, don´t really care for them. 2.  The seagull looks totally fake and out of place, don´t get why you put it there. 3.  The selective blurring, especially on the left side of the photo are not making this a better photo in my opinion. I do like the grain and coloring and the look of the image though and voted a 6 in spite of all three issues I have with this shot.', '2007-01-04 19:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182430, 442194, 27482, '<td valign="top">I like the coloring and clarity of this image, not quite getting what it has to do with the challenge but didn´t deduct points as I am sure I am just not getting it and you have some thought behind it.  Voted a 7.</td>', 'I like the coloring and clarity of this image, not quite getting what it has to do with the challenge but didn´t deduct points as I am sure I am just not getting it and you have some thought behind it.  Voted a 7.', '2007-01-04 19:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182432, 443792, 27482, '<td valign="top">This shot is nice but I have a feeling it is one of those shots that needs to be BIG up on a wall to pop, it just doesn´t do that in web resolution.  6 from me</td>', 'This shot is nice but I have a feeling it is one of those shots that needs to be BIG up on a wall to pop, it just doesn´t do that in web resolution.  6 from me', '2007-01-04 19:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182437, 442341, 27482, '<td valign="top">I have a hard time saying anything about this shot as I find it neither good or bad.  I like the color of the foreground, dislike the bland grey sky and the lack of a strong subject that pulls at my attention.  5</td>', 'I have a hard time saying anything about this shot as I find it neither good or bad.  I like the color of the foreground, dislike the bland grey sky and the lack of a strong subject that pulls at my attention.  5', '2007-01-04 19:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182457, 443809, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well this is pretty good, I like the strong contrast and the colors in this.  You have probably gotten comments about the yellow can or oxygen tank in the top beling blown out and also the box next to it and all I can say is I definately agree that it kindof knocks this shot a bit down as it just draws too much attention to it.  Still above average and got a 6 from me.</td>', 'Well this is pretty good, I like the strong contrast and the colors in this.  You have probably gotten comments about the yellow can or oxygen tank in the top beling blown out and also the box next to it and all I can say is I definately agree that it kindof knocks this shot a bit down as it just draws too much attention to it.  Still above average and got a 6 from me.', '2007-01-04 19:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182464, 442700, 27482, '<td valign="top">This shot is very nice but I gotta say, that lightning looks really out of place and I actually knocked this shot down a point for it, this shot would have been stronger without it.  That´s it though, the rest of the shot I really like and I voted an 8, great job.</td>', 'This shot is very nice but I gotta say, that lightning looks really out of place and I actually knocked this shot down a point for it, this shot would have been stronger without it.  That´s it though, the rest of the shot I really like and I voted an 8, great job.', '2007-01-04 19:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182490, 442529, 27482, '<td valign="top">I have a hard time saying anything about this shot as I find it neither good or bad, the composition is nice but I would have liked it better if it had stronger contrast.  5 from me.</td>', 'I have a hard time saying anything about this shot as I find it neither good or bad, the composition is nice but I would have liked it better if it had stronger contrast.  5 from me.', '2007-01-04 19:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
