(3182505, 443540, 27482, '<td valign="top">I have a hard time saying anything about this shot as I find it neither good or bad, I like the sky though but dislike the centered composition of the crane or whatever it is.</td>', 'I have a hard time saying anything about this shot as I find it neither good or bad, I like the sky though but dislike the centered composition of the crane or whatever it is.', '2007-01-04 19:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182508, 442346, 27482, '<td valign="top">I have a hard time saying anything about this shot as I find it neither good or bad, would have liked it better with stronger contrast but the subject just isn´t interesting to me personally.  5</td>', 'I have a hard time saying anything about this shot as I find it neither good or bad, would have liked it better with stronger contrast but the subject just isn´t interesting to me personally.  5', '2007-01-04 19:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182518, 443069, 27482, '<td valign="top">I have a hard time saying anything about this shot as I find it neither good or bad, just something about the lighting and DOF that just doesn´t appeal to me. Some burning on the hand and an visible but still out of focus head/face would have scored higher with me and it also bothers me a bit that the tip of the gun is so prominent in the composition and yet out of focus.  5 from me.</td>', 'I have a hard time saying anything about this shot as I find it neither good or bad, just something about the lighting and DOF that just doesn´t appeal to me. Some burning on the hand and an visible but still out of focus head/face would have scored higher with me and it also bothers me a bit that the tip of the gun is so prominent in the composition and yet out of focus.  5 from me.', '2007-01-04 19:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182530, 442587, 27482, '<td valign="top">I have a hard time saying anything about this shot as I find it neither good or bad.  I like the coloring in the shot, dislike the moving flame and the strong halo on the orange to the left.  5 from me.</td>', 'I have a hard time saying anything about this shot as I find it neither good or bad.  I like the coloring in the shot, dislike the moving flame and the strong halo on the orange to the left.  5 from me.', '2007-01-04 19:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182534, 443860, 27482, '<td valign="top">I have a hard time saying anything about this shot as I find it neither good or bad.  Usually I like grain in black and white photos but here I think I would have liked it better if it were crispy clean and sharp.  Also I don´t really find anything interesting in the frame to stop and gawk at.  5 from me.</td>', 'I have a hard time saying anything about this shot as I find it neither good or bad.  Usually I like grain in black and white photos but here I think I would have liked it better if it were crispy clean and sharp.  Also I don´t really find anything interesting in the frame to stop and gawk at.  5 from me.', '2007-01-04 19:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182539, 443036, 27482, '<td valign="top">I have a hard time saying anything about this shot as I find it neither good or bad.  I like the light coming through the trees, I would have voted higher if it had stronger contrast.  5 from me.</td>', 'I have a hard time saying anything about this shot as I find it neither good or bad.  I like the light coming through the trees, I would have voted higher if it had stronger contrast.  5 from me.', '2007-01-04 19:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182548, 442668, 27482, '<td valign="top">I like the look of the image, the strong contrast and clarity and think it´s above average so I voted a 6.  I do find it a bit busy though and nothing specific draws my attention, also I would have removed that blue sign to the left as it is the only blue in the shot, it just steals attention.</td>', 'I like the look of the image, the strong contrast and clarity and think it´s above average so I voted a 6.  I do find it a bit busy though and nothing specific draws my attention, also I would have removed that blue sign to the left as it is the only blue in the shot, it just steals attention.', '2007-01-04 19:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182557, 442429, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well this is hardly what I would call an harsh environment but I am from Iceland so I won´t deduct points for that :)<br/> <br/>I do like this shot, I like the colors and tones in it.  Two things though that stopped me voting higher than a 7 (wich is good for me, I am picky) and that is the house to the left being half cut off like that, just draws attention from the big house and also the shrubs at the bottom of the frame also draw too much attention.  I would have opted for a wider lens and gotten closer over those shrubs or some other way to eliminate them.</td>', 'Well this is hardly what I would call an harsh environment but I am from Iceland so I won´t deduct points for that :) I do like this shot, I like the colors and tones in it.  Two things though that stopped me voting higher than a 7 (wich is good for me, I am picky) and that is the house to the left being half cut off like that, just draws attention from the big house and also the shrubs at the bottom of the frame also draw too much attention.  I would have opted for a wider lens and gotten closer over those shrubs or some other way to eliminate them.', '2007-01-04 19:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182672, 443594, 42100, '<td valign="top">Looks mighty cold for your model...but a very cool looking photograph.  Well done!</td>', 'Looks mighty cold for your model...but a very cool looking photograph.  Well done!', '2007-01-04 20:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182676, 443277, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very unique look with those colored balconies in front of all those frosted trees.  Really cool photograph!</td>', 'Very unique look with those colored balconies in front of all those frosted trees.  Really cool photograph!', '2007-01-04 20:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182681, 442686, 42100, '<td valign="top">No exaggeration here...they really are like that.  Her expression is spot on.  Nicely done!</td>', 'No exaggeration here...they really are like that.  Her expression is spot on.  Nicely done!', '2007-01-04 20:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182695, 443378, 42100, '<td valign="top">Definitely a very barren scene, a forest fire I assume.  The photograph looks great and the tones are perfect for the photo.  Well done!</td>', 'Definitely a very barren scene, a forest fire I assume.  The photograph looks great and the tones are perfect for the photo.  Well done!', '2007-01-04 20:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182710, 441839, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice triptych.   The scene is very gloomy on many levels, but the brightness of selected color gives hope.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Very nice triptych.   The scene is very gloomy on many levels, but the brightness of selected color gives hope.  Nicely done!', '2007-01-04 20:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182717, 442700, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic and impressive photograph.  I like the monochromaticness of it with just the hint of color.  Well done!</td>', 'Very dramatic and impressive photograph.  I like the monochromaticness of it with just the hint of color.  Well done!', '2007-01-04 20:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182793, 443913, 33515, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I might like it a bit more if the star fish was not so centered. 8</td>', 'Very nice, I might like it a bit more if the star fish was not so centered. 8', '2007-01-04 20:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182796, 443273, 33515, '<td valign="top">Very good, just seems a bit to centered.</td>', 'Very good, just seems a bit to centered.', '2007-01-04 20:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182808, 443863, 33515, '<td valign="top">I like the placement of the raccoon and how the gut trail takes you to the center of the frame<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-27 11:55:01.</i></td>', 'I like the placement of the raccoon and how the gut trail takes you to the center of the frame', '2007-01-04 20:43:34.000000', '2007-01-27 11:55:01.000000', 1),
(3182863, 443440, 59276, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2007-01-04 21:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182880, 443913, 59276, '<td valign="top">it doesn''t look so harsh there, infact I would love to be sitting there on the beach, but I''m sure that the star fish doesn''t<br/>I like the comp and light</td>', 'it doesn''t look so harsh there, infact I would love to be sitting there on the beach, but I''m sure that the star fish doesn''tI like the comp and light', '2007-01-04 21:12:44.000000', NULL, 1);
