(3183702, 443625, 1717, '<td valign="top">this is a fun pic, B!  congrats on top 10.  it''s sad that it got so many low scores and comments about it not being photography.  if Expert Editing was the only type of challenge here i could understand their comments.  but, it''s just a small part, meant to be fun.  it''s too bad that they feel the need to punish people who participate in the challenges because everyone doesn''t agree with their definition of photographic art.</td>', 'this is a fun pic, B!  congrats on top 10.  it''s sad that it got so many low scores and comments about it not being photography.  if Expert Editing was the only type of challenge here i could understand their comments.  but, it''s just a small part, meant to be fun.  it''s too bad that they feel the need to punish people who participate in the challenges because everyone doesn''t agree with their definition of photographic art.', '2007-01-05 01:00:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3183704, 443394, 62187, '<td valign="top">Dain,<br/> <br/>At the risk of sounding like a stuffy old school marm - the comments that you didn''t check as ''helpful'' should be a clue and you should have found them the MOST helpful of all. As to date, the only comment you have checked as ''helpful'' is the comment that is flattering to your photo. You have also received 80 comments to your photos and made none to anybody elses. What''s up with that? I think you owe a little give rather then all take. If you have a legitimate reason for this, then I apologize - if not, then get busy and start contributing to the cause please. Thanks...</td>', 'Dain, At the risk of sounding like a stuffy old school marm - the comments that you didn''t check as ''helpful'' should be a clue and you should have found them the MOST helpful of all. As to date, the only comment you have checked as ''helpful'' is the comment that is flattering to your photo. You have also received 80 comments to your photos and made none to anybody elses. What''s up with that? I think you owe a little give rather then all take. If you have a legitimate reason for this, then I apologize - if not, then get busy and start contributing to the cause please. Thanks...', '2007-01-05 01:01:18.000000', NULL, 0),
