(3184193, 442857, 23484, '<td valign="top">Good job Kelli. I really love the colors in this.</td>', 'Good job Kelli. I really love the colors in this.', '2007-01-05 07:33:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3184194, 443917, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=447648" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/53572/thumb/447648.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/53572/thumb/447648.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/53572/thumb/447648.jpg"/></a>ewll, it''s obvious that mary and i think similarly!  i ran this through alien skins cross process e100, but to get a similar result you could do a high pass layer, contrast, and hue/sat bumping up red.    then i did a gradient layer for the vignette, and after flattening a gaussian blur layer.  both the gradient and blur are masked to choose only the areas i wanted affected.<br/> <br/>it''s a great image, but i agree with the flatness comments.  t just mneeds a little oomph to get it going.</td>', 'ewll, it''s obvious that mary and i think similarly!  i ran this through alien skins cross process e100, but to get a similar result you could do a high pass layer, contrast, and hue/sat bumping up red.    then i did a gradient layer for the vignette, and after flattening a gaussian blur layer.  both the gradient and blur are masked to choose only the areas i wanted affected. it''s a great image, but i agree with the flatness comments.  t just mneeds a little oomph to get it going.', '2007-01-05 07:34:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3184197, 441885, 24454, '<td valign="top">This was one of my very favorites.  It''s beautiful work, and I so appreciate reading about their lives.   I never thought about the empowerment thing of having children -- also, I guess it feels great to nurture and protect something they love too!<br/> <br/>This is powerful!  Congratulations on an amazing photo and experience -and the reward of top 10 honors as well!!</td>', 'This was one of my very favorites.  It''s beautiful work, and I so appreciate reading about their lives.   I never thought about the empowerment thing of having children -- also, I guess it feels great to nurture and protect something they love too! This is powerful!  Congratulations on an amazing photo and experience -and the reward of top 10 honors as well!!', '2007-01-05 07:38:06.000000', NULL, 0),
