(3184375, 443830, 12200, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how anyone could have given this a 1, even in such an intensely competitive challenge...save for the possibility (against the rules) of feeling that it didn''t meet the challenge theme as well as others. In my opinion, this was among the most "photographic in nature" compositions submitted, and I hope you''ll consider working this one up into a print for others to enjoy.</td>', 'I don''t know how anyone could have given this a 1, even in such an intensely competitive challenge...save for the possibility (against the rules) of feeling that it didn''t meet the challenge theme as well as others. In my opinion, this was among the most "photographic in nature" compositions submitted, and I hope you''ll consider working this one up into a print for others to enjoy.', '2007-01-05 09:31:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3184382, 443646, 12200, '<td valign="top">I graded this one a 6 during the challenge, but now that I reflect more upon my rating, I think I erred on this one. This is really a very striking shot, even if not the most original in this challenge. Thanks for sharing this piece of work.</td>', 'I graded this one a 6 during the challenge, but now that I reflect more upon my rating, I think I erred on this one. This is really a very striking shot, even if not the most original in this challenge. Thanks for sharing this piece of work.', '2007-01-05 09:35:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3184386, 442395, 12200, '<td valign="top">I second TCGuru''s sentiments. This one was among my top three, and I am stunned it didn''t make the top 10 at least.</td>', 'I second TCGuru''s sentiments. This one was among my top three, and I am stunned it didn''t make the top 10 at least.', '2007-01-05 09:37:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3184390, 443830, 26756, '<td valign="top">I love the shot, it''s beautiful.  To me it almost looks more like smoke.  I wonder if you had named it "fire on the mountain" or something like that if it would have had a different effect for people.</td>', 'I love the shot, it''s beautiful.  To me it almost looks more like smoke.  I wonder if you had named it "fire on the mountain" or something like that if it would have had a different effect for people.', '2007-01-05 09:39:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(3184395, 443706, 57229, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments. <br/>3 pictures, one of the men, one of the fjord and one of the moon in the night sky. <br/>I should have left the moon out, maybe - got a bit conceptually carried away.<br/>Another thing that I might have done is explained in the title that these are two heroin addicts cooking up a fix.<br/>Then again, dpc is a family programme, so maybe I just shouldn''t show things like that at all.<br/>I chose the shot with the faces hidden in case their mothers see it.<br/>The black sky is toned down by choice to fit in with the fjord, but all of that''s pretty disastrously done, so . . .<br/>I''m sorry to say that the contents of this picture are, indeed, real.<br/>The frozen fjord and the people are taken within twenty yards and ten minutes of each other.<br/>I hang my head.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments. 3 pictures, one of the men, one of the fjord and one of the moon in the night sky. I should have left the moon out, maybe - got a bit conceptually carried away.Another thing that I might have done is explained in the title that these are two heroin addicts cooking up a fix.Then again, dpc is a family programme, so maybe I just shouldn''t show things like that at all.I chose the shot with the faces hidden in case their mothers see it.The black sky is toned down by choice to fit in with the fjord, but all of that''s pretty disastrously done, so . . .I''m sorry to say that the contents of this picture are, indeed, real.The frozen fjord and the people are taken within twenty yards and ten minutes of each other.I hang my head.', '2007-01-05 09:44:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3184404, 442842, 36832, '<td valign="top">Ok, after reading your post-processing, I''m even more impressed!  Very well done indeed.  Wish I knew how to do all that stuff.  Great! Great! Great!</td>', 'Ok, after reading your post-processing, I''m even more impressed!  Very well done indeed.  Wish I knew how to do all that stuff.  Great! Great! Great!', '2007-01-05 09:47:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(3184411, 443509, 50864, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful shot and a great blend of the 3 photos. I should have thought of that with the Badwater (salt formations) shot. I did do the HDR but I wish I had a better shot of the background mountains to blend with the foreground. Wonderful photo of an amazing part of the country</td>', 'What a beautiful shot and a great blend of the 3 photos. I should have thought of that with the Badwater (salt formations) shot. I did do the HDR but I wish I had a better shot of the background mountains to blend with the foreground. Wonderful photo of an amazing part of the country', '2007-01-05 09:52:47.000000', NULL, 0),
