(3184629, 443646, 51538, '<td valign="top">My conclusion after looking at your photos is that Romania is at least as picturesque as Iceland.  Keep up the good work.  I like the interesting photos you bring to DPC from your country.</td>', 'My conclusion after looking at your photos is that Romania is at least as picturesque as Iceland.  Keep up the good work.  I like the interesting photos you bring to DPC from your country.', '2007-01-05 11:34:15.000000', NULL, 0),
