(3184741, 443921, 64733, '<td valign="top">again, i think your score isn''t reflective of the image, considering the special effects a lot of people put on theirs.  however, i want to see more: more of the tree, more sky, and more of its surrounding environment.  i guess it''s hard to determine exactly how harsh this is.  i don''t mind the power lines through the moon, but they probably could have been removed easily.  <br/> <br/>i''d like to see the outtakes!</td>', 'again, i think your score isn''t reflective of the image, considering the special effects a lot of people put on theirs.  however, i want to see more: more of the tree, more sky, and more of its surrounding environment.  i guess it''s hard to determine exactly how harsh this is.  i don''t mind the power lines through the moon, but they probably could have been removed easily.   i''d like to see the outtakes!', '2007-01-05 11:55:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3184764, 443755, 3724, '<td valign="top">9 - enjoyable montage.  Muted/subdued/filtered colour intensity has an appropriate quality and somehow complements this gravel pit.  Pasted placard bolted on air, resting on a thin rod, provides identification and a quick entry for my eye to begin exploring.  In the end, the sign is awkward.  I want a way to have an option to remove it, or make it smaller, and see these texture/composition relationships without such a loud warning.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-05 12:11:59.</i></td>', '9 - enjoyable montage.  Muted/subdued/filtered colour intensity has an appropriate quality and somehow complements this gravel pit.  Pasted placard bolted on air, resting on a thin rod, provides identification and a quick entry for my eye to begin exploring.  In the end, the sign is awkward.  I want a way to have an option to remove it, or make it smaller, and see these texture/composition relationships without such a loud warning.', '2007-01-05 12:03:13.000000', '2007-01-05 12:11:59.000000', 0),
(3184770, 442700, 51900, '<td valign="top">should have gotten blue<br/></td>', 'should have gotten blue', '2007-01-05 12:04:30.000000', NULL, 0),
