(3185209, 442395, 19708, '<td valign="top">There''s just something about this that I really love.<br/>The creativity and how you made it all work together is great, and somehow can see this in a display, with each section being in a transparent glass pane, hanging by tiny wires, in a 3D display somewhere.</td>', 'There''s just something about this that I really love.The creativity and how you made it all work together is great, and somehow can see this in a display, with each section being in a transparent glass pane, hanging by tiny wires, in a 3D display somewhere.', '2007-01-05 14:49:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3185239, 443755, 66384, '<td valign="top">I hardly know what to say. I love this composition, but don''t know why. Everything about it pleases my eye. Someone said it is busy. I think it is infinitely interesting. I gave it a 10.</td>', 'I hardly know what to say. I love this composition, but don''t know why. Everything about it pleases my eye. Someone said it is busy. I think it is infinitely interesting. I gave it a 10.', '2007-01-05 15:03:38.000000', NULL, 0),
