(3185259, 443916, 66384, '<td valign="top">I agree with SkyNavada about smoothing the two sharp lines in the center. I find them distracting. Unlike many of the other voters, I think abstract  art is a valid form of photography. And I find this image exciting and pleasing. I would prefer it without the stuff in the upper right corner.</td>', 'I agree with SkyNavada about smoothing the two sharp lines in the center. I find them distracting. Unlike many of the other voters, I think abstract  art is a valid form of photography. And I find this image exciting and pleasing. I would prefer it without the stuff in the upper right corner.', '2007-01-05 15:13:44.000000', NULL, 0),
