(3185313, 443801, 66384, '<td valign="top">You got a 10 from me. I guess I like "busy" photographs. The scene is definitely a harsh environment, and adding the cat (which definitely does not look added) showed for whom it is harsh. I like everything about this image.</td>', 'You got a 10 from me. I guess I like "busy" photographs. The scene is definitely a harsh environment, and adding the cat (which definitely does not look added) showed for whom it is harsh. I like everything about this image.', '2007-01-05 15:42:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3185323, 443415, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful image. The composition, colors, and especially the beautiful soaring eagle. I love the fanned out tail. And I like the position of the eagle in the composition -- soaring into the shot rather than out of it. The misty soft feel of the landscape is a nice contrast to the sharp eagle. Definite wow factor here, and I gave it a 10.</td>', 'This is a wonderful image. The composition, colors, and especially the beautiful soaring eagle. I love the fanned out tail. And I like the position of the eagle in the composition -- soaring into the shot rather than out of it. The misty soft feel of the landscape is a nice contrast to the sharp eagle. Definite wow factor here, and I gave it a 10.', '2007-01-05 15:50:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3185349, 442857, 66384, '<td valign="top">For me, the skull is too bright/blown out. I find it distracting, because it prevents me from seeing it clearly. I really like the composition and color. I just wish it wasn''t so bright in the center. Of course too bright is what makes the environment so harsh, but I would rather see this conveyed without blowing out the highlights.</td>', 'For me, the skull is too bright/blown out. I find it distracting, because it prevents me from seeing it clearly. I really like the composition and color. I just wish it wasn''t so bright in the center. Of course too bright is what makes the environment so harsh, but I would rather see this conveyed without blowing out the highlights.', '2007-01-05 15:59:57.000000', NULL, 0),
