(3185823, 442842, 27373, '<td valign="top">Fabulous shot, well thought out and exectued.  One question: <br/> What do you think led to the "floating" look of the man?  When I first saw it I really thought it was a bit of a lighting issue- ie standing out a bit much compared to the rest of the scene or maybe lack of shadows.  But after looking at it more I think it might be a sense of scale.  He seems almost a little too big for the overall shot.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Fabulous shot, well thought out and exectued.  One question:  What do you think led to the "floating" look of the man?  When I first saw it I really thought it was a bit of a lighting issue- ie standing out a bit much compared to the rest of the scene or maybe lack of shadows.  But after looking at it more I think it might be a sense of scale.  He seems almost a little too big for the overall shot. ', '2007-01-05 18:16:48.000000', NULL, 0),
