(3185851, 443068, 48717, '<td valign="top">I loved this one from the moment I saw it.  Glad to see it on the front page and glad to see it win without the fancy editing!  Congrats on your first ribbon.</td>', 'I loved this one from the moment I saw it.  Glad to see it on the front page and glad to see it win without the fancy editing!  Congrats on your first ribbon.', '2007-01-05 18:28:48.000000', NULL, 0),
