(3188759, 443755, 30982, '<td valign="top">An interesting thing - I never stopped to figure there were multiple images.  I mean it kinda seems like there must be, but it really hangs together so well that the mind doesn''t question whether or not it logically CAN fit together, simply because it DOES fit together.  Scary that you scored so high and didn''t simply create a "DPC friendly" image... wonder what THAT says?  And there''s no explaining my sudden urge to type whole words in CAPS.  I think it has to do with my aversion to the folks that alTERnatE case in their titles.  Drives me nuts.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-06 15:46:25.</i></td>', 'An interesting thing - I never stopped to figure there were multiple images.  I mean it kinda seems like there must be, but it really hangs together so well that the mind doesn''t question whether or not it logically CAN fit together, simply because it DOES fit together.  Scary that you scored so high and didn''t simply create a "DPC friendly" image... wonder what THAT says?  And there''s no explaining my sudden urge to type whole words in CAPS.  I think it has to do with my aversion to the folks that alTERnatE case in their titles.  Drives me nuts.', '2007-01-06 15:43:06.000000', '2007-01-06 15:46:25.000000', 0),
