(3210699, 443708, 68504, '<td valign="top">I very much like the tonality and elements (shapes, lines) - just how it is is how it should be - something I don''t often see.  However I do think it is not perfectly balanced, and it may be the angle of view as suggested below, or a matter of cropping.</td>', 'I very much like the tonality and elements (shapes, lines) - just how it is is how it should be - something I don''t often see.  However I do think it is not perfectly balanced, and it may be the angle of view as suggested below, or a matter of cropping.', '2007-01-11 03:36:43.000000', NULL, 0),
