(3303794, 443594, 30214, '<td valign="top">great concept, and a pretty good execution. Love the composition, and the right hand is magnetizing. A couple of things take away from the image: the background is too visibly painted in, and the line between the leg and the left hand is a bit oversharpened. Since it is right in the focal point of the composition, it jumps out on a viewer. But overall - great work, congrats!</td>', 'great concept, and a pretty good execution. Love the composition, and the right hand is magnetizing. A couple of things take away from the image: the background is too visibly painted in, and the line between the leg and the left hand is a bit oversharpened. Since it is right in the focal point of the composition, it jumps out on a viewer. But overall - great work, congrats!', '2007-01-30 16:27:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3304550, 442429, 39057, '<td valign="top">Seems sort of pleasant not harsh.</td>', 'Seems sort of pleasant not harsh.', '2007-01-30 20:38:18.000000', NULL, 0),
