(4328204, 443646, 63269, '<td valign="top">delicious eye candy. The way the scene is set in layers is very intriguing - and each layer gets more and more foggy. Yet despite the fact that the fog blurs things, it appears to still be in focus. Wonderful work. The tones here are beautiful. I love it!</td>', 'delicious eye candy. The way the scene is set in layers is very intriguing - and each layer gets more and more foggy. Yet despite the fact that the fog blurs things, it appears to still be in focus. Wonderful work. The tones here are beautiful. I love it!', '2007-12-21 12:36:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4328598, 443646, 87998, '<td valign="top">fantastic image. great treatment</td>', 'fantastic image. great treatment', '2007-12-21 14:58:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4564919, 442112, 51793, '<td valign="top">The door is upside down. I didn''t see it at first but then I thought the door handle looked a little high and then I noticed the top of the door was at the bottom. hahah, Good take on the challenge but I think the blurry was what pinged ya. There is some lighting problems too but I mean there is a fire coming from behind the door after all. hahaha <br/> <br/>Anyway good take on the challenge. WTG<br/></td>', 'The door is upside down. I didn''t see it at first but then I thought the door handle looked a little high and then I noticed the top of the door was at the bottom. hahah, Good take on the challenge but I think the blurry was what pinged ya. There is some lighting problems too but I mean there is a fire coming from behind the door after all. hahaha  Anyway good take on the challenge. WTG', '2008-03-15 08:49:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4564920, 443891, 51793, '<td valign="top">I think the expression in your eyes wasn''t enough. It looks like you''re staging it (which I know you are) but I would think if you were REALLY abducted you''re eyes would be wide open and they would be saying HOLY SH!T SOMEONE HELP ME. Over all though, good job. Can''t wait to see if you enter Harsh Environments II.</td>', 'I think the expression in your eyes wasn''t enough. It looks like you''re staging it (which I know you are) but I would think if you were REALLY abducted you''re eyes would be wide open and they would be saying HOLY SH!T SOMEONE HELP ME. Over all though, good job. Can''t wait to see if you enter Harsh Environments II.', '2008-03-15 08:52:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4564922, 443601, 51793, '<td valign="top">Why is there fire behind the girls??? Does one of them get so man they start a fire? hahaha good try man. I hope you enter the new challenge. BTW this is my boys EVERY DAY.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-03-15 08:55:54.</i></td>', 'Why is there fire behind the girls??? Does one of them get so man they start a fire? hahaha good try man. I hope you enter the new challenge. BTW this is my boys EVERY DAY.', '2008-03-15 08:53:58.000000', '2008-03-15 08:55:54.000000', 0),
